Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玛丽安太太 - 是九码半的吗？\N- Mrs. Mariann. - You have the nine and a half?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 可给你找到了 - 太好了\N- Yeah, you're a lucky lady. - Oh, I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一双了 来 露个玉足吧\NLast pair. Let me see those beautiful feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,右脚还可以吧？\NThe right foot's all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,来 用力伸进去\NThere you go. Get it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太小了 - 加油 加油\N- They're too tight. - It's okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.77,0:00:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这真是九码半？ - 对 九码半\N- Are these the nine and a half? - These are the nine and a half, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有大一号的吗？ - 唯独这牌子没有\N- Do you have the next size? - No, not in a Kerrybrooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.73,0:00:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不推荐凯步轩\NBut that's why I don't like Kerrybrooke,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,穿他们鞋 跟裹小脚一样\Nbecause they fit really small. They're made for dolls or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太不合脚了 - 好吧 脱下来吧 脱下来吧\N- They're too tight. - Okay, take 'em off. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.93,0:00:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 穿过足力康吗？ - 没有\N- You ever try Vitality? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:00:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这牌子档次更高 更耐穿 - 稍等一下\N- It's a much better model if you want durable leather. - I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打扰了 - 拿来试试吧\N- Excuse me. Sorry. - I'll try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我要找前几天卖我鞋的 戴眼镜的那位\NI bought a pair of shoes here the other day from him, with the glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 - 怎么了？\N- Marty. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有位顾客找你 前几天是你卖她鞋吗？\NThis woman said she bought a pair of shoes from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 对 是买了那双棕色玛丽珍吧\NOh, yeah. You bought the brown Mary Janes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 鞋挺好的 - 合脚吗？\N- Yeah, I did. They're great. - How do they fit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我当时穿着就走了 - 好\N- I wore them out of the store. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后旧鞋就落在这里了 - 旧鞋长什么样？\N- So I left my old ones here. - Okay. What did they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,拼色高跟鞋 带小翅膀图案\NThey're two-toned pumps, wingtips.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛伊 有见到那鞋吗？ - 没有\N- Lloyd, did you see her shoes? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.39,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不会被你们装回我没拿走的鞋盒\NIs it possible that you maybe put them in one of the boxes of the other shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,然后又塞回库房了吧？\Nthat I was trying on and restocked them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧... - 要是看见鞋盒 我就能认出来\N- Okay. All right. Um... - If I saw the boxes, I'd be able to recognize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,让我同事来帮您选购好吗？\NDo you mind if my colleague helps you out for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 你帮忙接待一下这位行吗？\NLloyd. Can you help with Mariann here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.91,0:01:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 等下\NSure. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走 跟我去仓库 - 谢谢 借过\N- Yeah, we'll check the basement. Come. - Thank you. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛伊会拿来足力康的 - 好吧 我得考虑下价格\N- Lloyd's gonna help you. Get the Vitalities. - Okay. I'll think about the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 您先坐会儿 我马上就来 - 好的 谢谢\N- I'll be right with you. Let me finish up here. - Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.70,0:01:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 嘘\N- What? - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是马蒂吧? - 是 真倒霉\N- Marty. - Ah, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.11,0:01:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,给你看个东西 进来一下\NI wanna show you something. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 蹲下 赶紧蹲下\N- What? - Just get low. Go low.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我干嘛非得蹲着啊?\NWhy do I have to get low?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 舅 一切还好吧 - 马蒂 瞧瞧我给你准备的\N- How you doing? - Marty, look what I got for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:01:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西？\NWhat is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:01:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细瞧瞧\NCheck it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有啥特别的？\NWhat am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.77,0:02:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看看背面\NTurn it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 做管事? - 对 管事\N- Manager? - Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧 老默\NCome on, Murray.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,答不答应 千万别跟洛伊提这事儿啊\NWhatever you do, just don't tell Lloyd about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.95,0:02:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,舅 我不是不尊重你 但把话讲明白\NLook, I've been very clear with you. I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这店子你经营得确实不错\Ntrying to be disrespectful. You built something very commendable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,现在别 别谈这些\NI don't wanna-- I don't wanna discuss this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别打断我 让我说完\NStop. Stop. Let me say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这活确实让我学到不少\NIt's been good for my soul to see this up close and personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但我不是来卖鞋的 - 我不想听这些\N- But I'm not a shoe salesman. - I don't wanna discuss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不是这块料 - 别扯这些 行吗？\N- I'm not a shoe salesman. - I don't wanna discuss this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,必须谈 等我飞走 我就不干了\NI do wanna discuss it, 'cause when I'm back from my trip, this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可能留在这行\NI'm not coming back and doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,说到这 工钱现在能结吗 我得去买机票\NSpeaking of which, can we settle up now? I gotta buy my plane ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,打烊再结\NWe'll settle at closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我得趁午休去买票\NI wanted to see the travel agent on my lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿到钱肯定不回来了\NYou'll never come back after your lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你真把我看成那种人？\NThat's what you think of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 你真以为我会跑了不回来吗？\N- Yes. - You think I would go and not come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我说了打烊再结 行吗？\NYes. I said settle at closing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这样？ - 对 就这样 出去吧\N- That's it? - Yeah, that's it. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.73,0:02:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真是我的好舅舅\NI love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.49,0:02:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 等我一下\N- Come on. - Wait. Just wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:03:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我本来就...正要去你家的 - 啥？\N- I was about... I was about to come to you. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 艾勒在家病着呢\NNo, Ira's home sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂喂喂 什么病 别传染给我 - 什么？\N- Whoa, whoa, whoa. I can't get sick. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去打锦标赛 我可不能病\NI got the championships.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 他是吃坏肚子了 只是吃坏肚子了\NNo, it's food poisoning. It's food poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真想把你塞进行李箱带走\NI wish I could hide you in my luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我也好想跟你走\NI wanna come with you so bad.
Comment: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:54.29,Title,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（至尊马蒂 美国制造）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:58.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 趁还有机会 跳起来吧 ♪\N♪ Let's dance in style, let's dance for a while ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:04:02.27,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 别靠天命 活在当下吧 ♪\N♪ Heaven can wait, we're only watching the skies ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:05.33,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 盼着好事 也做好最坏打算 ♪\N♪ Hoping for the best but expecting the worst ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:08.27,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 明天会不会就烟消云散？ ♪\N♪ Are you gonna drop the bomb or not? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:12.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 要么痛快地死 要么好好活下去 ♪\N♪ Let us die young or let us live forever ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.55,0:04:16.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 命靠天定 但我们偏要逆流而上 ♪\N♪ We don't have the power but we never say never ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:19.76,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 潮来潮去 人生苦短啊 ♪\N♪ Sitting in a sandpit, life is a short trip ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:22.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 能懂这歌的人 也懂我的伤 ♪\N♪ The music's for the sad men ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:26.10,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 这场竞赛会怎么收场？ ♪\N♪ Can you imagine when this race is won? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:30.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 是胜利还是灭亡？ ♪\N♪ Turn our golden faces into the sun ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:33.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我们唱着赞歌 别无选择 ♪\N♪ Praising our leaders, we're getting in tune ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:36.36,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 魔鬼弹着舞曲 逼我们起舞 ♪\N♪ The music's played by the, the mad man ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:38.09,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 永远年轻 ♪\N♪ Forever young ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:42.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我想永远年轻 ♪\N♪ I want to be forever young ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:46.91,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 谁不想永远活着？ ♪\N♪ Do you really want to live forever? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:50.87,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 永远永远地活着 ♪\N♪ Forever and ever ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.04,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 永远年轻 ♪\N♪ Forever young ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:56.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我想永远年轻 ♪\N♪ I want to be forever young ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:01.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 谁不想永远活着？ ♪\N♪ Do you really want to live forever? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,反手 反手 反手\NBackhand. Backhand. Backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,正手 正手 正手\NForehand. Forehand. Forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,反手 反手 反手\NBackhand. Backhand. Backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,正手 正手\NForehand. Forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,反手 反手\NBackhand. Backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,放高球\NAnd lob.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,正手\NForehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 - 干嘛\N- Marty! - What!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有电话 - 跟他说我二十分钟前就走了\N- Phone! - Tell him I left 20 minutes ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.87,0:05:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不当你的传声筒 自己去接那该死的电话\NI'm not your goddamn messenger! Pick up the goddamn phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟不上 沃利 把白衬衫脱了\NI can't. Wally, take the white shirt off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,白球配白衬衫 看不清\NI can't follow the white ball against the white shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别找借口 孬种才这样找借口\NStop it. You're a fucking sun dodger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我孬种？怎么怕了 怕了？\NOh, yeah? I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我是朱迪\NIt's Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 朱迪\NHi, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈病得很重\NYour mother, she's very sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的假的？ - 真的\N- Okay, really? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她脸色苍白 满嘴胡话\NShe's gray in the face. She's speaking nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直喊你 你得赶快回家一趟\NShe's asking for you. You should come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,听上去不行了 你们赶紧叫救护车吧\NSounds really bad. You should probably call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谁陪她去啊\NWho's gonna go with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 你这么上心 你陪她去呗\NUh, I don't know. You should probably go since you're so invested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:05:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 别挂\NHold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他不吃这套\NHe's not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.49,0:06:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说我断气了\NJust tell him I stopped breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不行 太严重了 我不能这么说\NAbsolutely not. That's ridiculous. I'm not saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说你正急着送我去医院\NTell him you're taking me to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我得赶紧把她送去急诊\NOkay, fine. I'll take her to the emergency room
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,然后在那儿陪着 天知道要陪多久\Nand sit there and wait for God knows how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你来负责伺候我丈夫 给他喂药\NAnd you can come here and give my husband his medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,“晚上给他翻身做按摩”\Nand massage his feet all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,“跟他说我晕倒了”\NTell him I passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.30,0:06:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- “天呐 你妈刚刚昏过去了” - 你好啊 小姑娘\N- Oh, my God! Your mother, she just lost consciousness. - Hi, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,“你现在赶紧回家”\NYou've gotta come home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谁啊\NHello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 饭马上好\NHi. Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.01,0:06:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,“朱迪 别闹了行吗”\NI don't know what you want me to say, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.81,0:06:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,“我正忙着 连午饭都还没吃呢”\NI'm busy. I'm on my lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,“我妈就在你旁边指挥 我都听得见”\NI can hear her whispering. She's right there standing next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- “我都说她昏过去了”- “别来烦我了”\N- I told you she passed out.- It's annoying me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟谁通话呢？\NWho are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 没人\NOh. I'm not talking to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,朱迪一直占着电话好久了\NJudy's just been tying up the line for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你买了点热饭\NI got you some broth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,都凉透了\NIt's ice cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.53,0:06:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 买饭排了好久 买回来都凉了 - 你都不打草稿？\N- Yeah, 'cause the line was really long at the shop. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,信不信我现在打电话去核实？\NSo that's what they'll say if I call down and ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是觉得我骗你\NYou don't believe me? You calling me a liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你就打电话核实去\NPick up the phone and call them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不过看你怎么打 朱迪在占着电话 - 喔 行\N- You're gonna have to get Judy off the phone first. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 朱迪 把电话给我挂掉\NHey, Judy, get off the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看 这颗是国际乒联标准球\NOkay, this is a normal IATT approved ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:20.15,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【国际乒乓球联合会：1926年成立 主管国际乒乓球赛事和规则】
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,盯紧这颗白球\NTry to follow the white ball against the white.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在白背景下挺难的吧\NAlmost impossible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你眼珠根本没跟上\NI don't even see your eyes moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我穿白衬衫 你连球都看不到\NIf I'm wearing a white shirt, you can't see the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,换颗橙球试试 这是我自个儿想出来的\NNow, imagine it with an orange ball, which no one's ever thought of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 你盯得多牢 瞧他那眼神\NSee? You're already following it way better. Look at his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看见没？ - 嗯 看见了\N- See how his eyes are looking? - Yeah, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在盯得更紧了\NYou're looking more engaged now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是机遇所在 目前桌上网球界\NSo that's what we wanna do. Right now in the world of table tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:39.08,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【桌球：乒乓球早期在上流场合叫做"桌上网球" 简称"桌球"】
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为了盯住白球都得穿黑衣\Nyou're obliged to wear black, just so you can follow the white ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看看这个 这是泰德·贝利 - 他是谁？\N- Look at this. That's Ted Bailey. - Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.70,0:07:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾是英国冠军 世界第一\NThat's ex-number one ranked player in the world right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,已经被我打败了\NHe's the British champion. I've already beat him, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,再看这个\NNow look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,网球界第一杰克·克雷默\NThat's Jack Kramer, number one tennis player.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:51.42,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【杰克·克雷默：40-50年代著名网球手 推动网球精英化】
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有啥区别？ - 他穿的是全白\N- What's the difference there? - He's wearing all white.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对 一身白 很绅士\NHe's in all white. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:55.56,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【50年代网球为绅士运动 桌上网球(乒乓球)尚非主流】
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.06,0:07:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫品味 这叫格调 这是卖点\NTo me, that's luxury. To me, that's class. You could sell that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 这种定制球得花不少钱\NMarty, a custom ball like that is gonna cost a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,当然得定制 奇人配奇球\NOf course it's custom. It's an original ball for an original guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是至尊马蒂牌 不是平庸马蒂牌\NIt's the Marty Supreme ball, not the Marty Normal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你算过成本吗？\NBut what's it gonna cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,钱不重要 咱别抠门\NIt doesn't matter the cost. We can't cheap out on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,花不了多少钱的 加拉尼斯先生\NIt's gonna be nominal, Mr. Galanis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是老说先花钱才能赚钱吗\NYou always said we gotta spend money to make money, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,给我端杯咖啡来\NGet me a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没门 让你秘书去弄\NNo. Get your secretary to get ya a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,南希忙着呢 你去弄吧\NNancy's busy. Just get me a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,才不 我正像大人那样谈生意\NDad, we're talking like men about business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我才不给你端咖啡 - 赶紧去给老子端咖啡去\N- I'm not getting ya a cup of coffee. - Get me the damn coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 也给你来一杯？\NMarty, you want a coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 不用了 我不碰咖啡因\NNo, I'm all right. I'm not drinking caffeine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\NListen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我感谢你和我儿子的这份交情\NI appreciate you're friends with my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不成器\NHe's limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,三十岁还靠爹吃饭\NHe's 30 years old. He's still living at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没啥名堂\NHe hasn't done much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他也不懂做生意 算不清账\NAnd he doesn't know business. He doesn't know the costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言 盖拉尼斯先生 我不觉得他不成器\NI don't think he's limited, Mr. Galanis, respectfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看看您做生意的本事\NI mean, look at your business success.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那是刻在骨子里的 迪翁也有\NThat's in your DNA, and you passed that through to Dion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只是还没显露出来 - 谁知道呢\N- It just hasn't been awoken yet. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是没把握\NI wouldn't be here trying to involve you in something that I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会拉您入伙的\Ndidn't fully in my bones believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我很尊重您的钱 说来您可能不信\NAnd I have tremendous respect for your money. I know it's hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但这门运动在国外是火得不得了\Nbut I'm telling you, this game, it fills stadiums overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在美国火起来也只是时间问题\NAnd it's only a matter of time before it fills stadiums in the United States too,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我的广告会铺天盖地\Nbefore I'm staring at you from the cover of a Wheaties box.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我对这行一窍不通\NI- I don't know nothing about this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,确实不通 所以更该信我\NNo, you don't. That's why you gotta trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.27,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,下周这个时候 我就是首位赢下英国公开赛的美国人\NThis time next week, I'll be the first American to ever win the British Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我就能一路杀到世锦赛 然后拿下世界第一\NThat'll slide me into the number one ranking for the World Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候《生活》和《展望》都会报道\NLife magazine's gonna cover it. Look magazine's gonna cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是板上钉钉的事 《展望》就在捧我 他们都会捧我\NThey have to. The editor of Look magazine, he loves me. They all love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我就是这项运动在美国的唯一代言人\NI'm uniquely positioned to be the face of the entire sport in the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊\NLloyd!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打样\NI'm closing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我来找我舅\NYeah, I can see that. Just here to see my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他走了\NHe left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,走了？你什么意思？不回来了？\NHe left? What do you mean he left? For the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他得带你妈去医院\NHe had to take your mother to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.48,0:10:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别闹了 她根本没病\NFor crying out loud. She's not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 他还欠我工钱 说好了今天结清\NHey, Lloyd, he owes me money. We were supposed to settle up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你午休了五个钟头\NWell, maybe if you didn't take that five-hour lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 兴许就能见着他 - 闭嘴吧你\N- you would have spoke with him. - Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁呀 - 吃了什么狗皮膏药 好得挺快的啊\N- Hello. - You're sounding a lot better, huh? That happened quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我会挺过去的 别指望我靠你\NI'll live, no thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 别扯了 默里在你那儿吗？别骗我\NEnough, Mom. Are you with Murray? Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 但他好像准备出趟远门\NNo. I think he left for his trip. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,出哪门子的远门？\NHis trip? What trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.27,0:10:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他带着埃丝特要去库彻度假村过周末\NHe's taking Esther to Kutchers for the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这算什么啊 - 只要我一句话 他就会留下\N- When this... - But he would have stayed if I asked him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本没病 妈 他答应给我机票钱的\NYou're not sick, Mom. He was supposed to give me my money for my flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子 那事我可不知道\NWell, I don't know anything about that, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别装蒜 否则我干嘛干这活？\NYes, you do! Why do you think I'm working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.91,0:10:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是为了挣那笔钱\NI literally only accepted this job for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:11:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我可比窦娥还冤\NI have no idea what you are implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道你在干嘛吗？ - 我在干嘛？\N- You know what this is? - What, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你在毁我 你在毁我前程\NThis is sabotage. You're sabotaging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别扯了 你是在自毁前程\NOh, please. You're sabotaging your own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 什么？\N- What is that? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然觉得我要抢你？\NAre you seriously thinking I'm gonna rob you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,职业反应\NJust a reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我要真想抢你 你早死在血泊里了\NIf I wanted to rob you, you'd be dead. You'd be in a pool of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来拿西装的 这是我特地为这趟比赛买的\NI came to grab my suit. You know I bought this specifically for my trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,打小乒乓还要穿西装 真长见识了\NDidn't know you need a suit to play ping pong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:29.61,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【乒乓：1950年代“乒乓”在部分场合带有嘲讽意味】
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我就要老默欠我的那七百块\NI just want the $700 that Murray owes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:40.53,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【1952年700美元约合2026年约8,600美元 6万人民币 26万新台币】
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不然呢？\NYeah, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.55,0:11:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不然我就往你腿上来一枪 - 你不敢\N- Or I'm gonna shoot you in the leg. - No you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢赌吗？\NYou sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是打我腿 你未来几年都得坐牢\NYou shoot me in the leg, you'll be spending the next few years in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,行 那我就朝你脑门开枪\NOkay, I'll shoot you in the head instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你没那胆子\NYou're not gonna do that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 听我说 我只拿走我的那七百 绝不多拿\NLook, Lloyd, I just want what was promised to me, not a penny more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,回来我会带回十倍奖金\NI'm gonna be coming home with ten times that amount in prize money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,睁只眼闭只眼吧 让我拿走欠我的\NSo just turn the other cheek, let me take what I'm owed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,等我回来给你整整一百\Nand I'll give you an even $100 dollars when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.42,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约1,230美元 8,600人民币 3.7万新台币】
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.43,0:11:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不干\NNot interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 别这样 转过来\NLloyd, come on. Look at me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,咱俩都清楚 你巴不得看我卷铺盖走人\NWe both know you'd love nothing more than to see my ass get canned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你干这行的劲头比我大千万倍\NYou're a thousand times more motivated than me to do this job,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可你看看吧\Nand yet look at this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,看看\NLook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.12,0:12:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,老默给我的 看看背面\NMurray gave that to me. Flip it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,管事 我要当你管事了\NManager. I'm gonna be your boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,公平吗？我能把你扫地出门\NHow unfair is that? I could fire you whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还能叫你跪着扫地\NI could tell you to sweep the floor on your hands and knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,任我差遣\NHow about that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 我真拿枪指着你\NLloyd, I'm actually pointing a gun at you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的在威胁你\NI'm actually threatening to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是实打实的抢劫 枪上有我的指纹\NThis is a legit robbery like any other. My fingerprints are all over this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.09,0:12:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是铁证\NThese are facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱柜打开 让我把该我的拿走\NSo open the safe, let me take what I'm owed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,回头你照实跟老默说\Nand you can call Murray, tell him exactly what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,想把我轰走还是告我都随你 行吗？\Nget me fired, press charges. Whatever you want, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,行\NFine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给您 先生 - 谢谢\N- Here you go, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:56.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我爱高光时刻 ♪\N♪ The time I like is the rush hour ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:58.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我爱人群喧嚣 ♪\N♪ 'Cause I like the rush ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:01.91,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 人群拥挤又吵闹 ♪\N♪ The pushing of the people ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.77,0:13:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,垃圾\NYou son of...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我就沉浸其中 ♪\N♪ I like it all so much ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:07.29,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 人潮蜂拥涌过来 ♪\N♪ Such a mass of motion ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.83,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 谁晓得要去哪儿 ♪\N♪ Do not know where it goes ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:13.21,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我随人群往前走 ♪\N♪ I move with the movement ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有单间吗？\NWe don't get our own rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:15.79,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:16.80,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 尽情享受这感觉 ♪\N♪ And I have the touch ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还冷得要死\NIt's freezing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在给我正经点儿 眼睛看这里\NI really need you to be serious now. Eyes on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,巴基斯坦 看这里\NPakistan, I need you to look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,日本今年也派队来了？瞧见没？\NWait, Japan brought a team this year? You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 小日本也来了\NYeah. The Japs sent a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,出国禁令呢？\NWhat about the travel ban?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:32.04,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【1952年随盟军移交日本主权 出入境管制开始放宽】
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯定解禁了 - 出国禁令解除了？\N- They must have lifted it. - No more travel ban?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 现在把球拍翻过来 露出国旗\NOkay, gentlemen, I want you to flip your paddles for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢配合\NThank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,准备 一 二 三\NHere we go. One. Two. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:40.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 握个手吧 ♪\N♪ Shake those hands ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\NHold it still.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:43.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 握个手吧 ♪\N♪ Shake those hands ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:45.79,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 握手 ♪\N♪ Shake hands ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:45.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第一轮）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:48.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 握手 ♪\N♪ Shake hands ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,毛瑟 赛点\NMatch point, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:14:02.63,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【赛点：率先达到者只需再得一分即可赢下整场比赛】
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:10.23,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【1950年代乒乓球普遍采用每局21分制 比赛多为五局三胜】
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.27,0:14:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 胜出\NMatch, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我太多正手机会了 应该逼我打反手\NYou let me get to my forehand too much. Should've tried to put me in my backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:28.43,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【译注：在乒乓球中正手利于进攻 反手偏防守】
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分\NPoint, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分\NPoint, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 几比几了？ - 19比4\N- What's the score here? - Nineteen-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 日本人领先？ - 那日本小子在揍烂贝利\N- The Japanese guy? - Japanese guy's trashing Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他手里是什么？那是什么球拍？\NWhat's he using? What's that paddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 没人见过\NI don't know, mate. No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没声音\NIt's silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 神出鬼没的 - 哇\N- Like a ghost! - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,贝利 好好打\NFuck, Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分\NPoint, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,赛点\NMatch point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.58,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第三轮）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.21,0:15:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打得好 马蒂 - 打得好\N- Great game, Marty. - Great game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:16:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 胜出\NMatch, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那些在斯德哥尔胜出的人...\NThe winners of the tournament at Stockholm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你是拉姆·塞西吧\NHey. You're Ram Sethi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 您先等一会儿\NSorry, could you hold for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不介意吧？ - 请说 您有啥事儿？\N- You don't mind? - No. Can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.57,0:16:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,打听个事 你们住在哪家酒店？\NI was just curious, where are you staying while you're in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这关您什么事儿？ - 没事\N- What business is it of yours? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就是随便打听下\NI'm just saying, what hotel are you staying at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,国际乒联儿的官员儿都住丽兹酒店\NAll the IATT representatives are stationed at the Ritz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 丽兹酒店？别人也这么说 - 对\N- At the Ritz? Yeah, that's what I heard. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这么定了 你没意见吧？ - 什么就这么定了？\N- Do you think that's okay? - I don't know what you're implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你见过我住的那地方吗？ - 有啥问题吗？\N- Have you seen where they put me? - Is it a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,客气说 那地方就是个狗窝\NWell, with all due respect, sir, it's a dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.01,0:16:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 真不好意思啊 没伺候好您这位\NI'm so sorry it doesn't meet your high standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,咱这儿可是免费包住的 毛瑟先生啊\NWe offer complimentary housing to all our players, Mr. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.51,0:16:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我就纳闷 怎么就您在这儿挑三拣四？\NSo far as I know, you're the only one to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你这口气 别把我当普通选手 好吗？\NYou're talking to me like I'm any player off the street, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我得休息好 才能赢下比赛\NI need good rest so I can win the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你很清楚美国人赢对这项运动的好处\NYou know perfectly well what an American win will do for the future of the sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就是未来桌球的代言人 - 那您就向美乒协反映呗\N- I'm good for table tennis, Mr. Sethi. - Appeal to the USTTA.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,美乒协有用吗？他们整个比赛就派两个人\NThere is no USTTA. The USTTA is two guys and a desk. It doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.73,0:17:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就不归我管了 - 就归你管\N- Well, that's not my problem. - It is your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我要住你住的那家酒店 就这么简单\NI wanna stay where you're staying! That's what I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,您这番言论实在是太失礼了\NI am finding this whole exchange really offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我失礼？ - 对 您失礼\N- You're offended? - I am offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们才失礼呢 让明星选手住狗窝\NI'm offended! You're making your star player huddle in a rat's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉刚才被打断了\NI'm so sorry for that interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那咱们接着说锡兰和墨西哥的事儿...\NUm, back to Ceylon and Mexico...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这酒店真不赖 肯定很贵 - 是啊 确实不错\N- This is a nice hotel. Must cost a mint. - Yeah, very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.33,0:17:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是国际乒联报销的吗？\NThe IATT covers accommodations?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明星选手才有这种待遇 - 是吗？那有多少名啊\N- Only for their star players. - Is that right? How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,明星选手？不知道 听说就一个\NStar players? I don't know. I haven't seen any others, so one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,进半决赛了 紧张吗？\NAny nerves, going into the semis?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,紧张？对阵克莱茨基？别闹了\NNerves? Against Kletzki? No. You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他已连续三年夺冠了\NWell, he's won the tournament for the last three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他名气可不小 - 我名气也不小\N- He's got quite the reputation. - I have quite the reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯维辛集中营都办不到的事 我要办成\NLook, I'm gonna do to Kletzki what Auschwitz couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,看我怎么把他灭了\NOkay. I'm gonna finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:53.07,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【奥斯维辛：纳粹设立的集中营 实施种族灭绝】
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 这话有点过了\N- Jesus Christ. - A little strong, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 我能说 我也是犹太人\NIt's all right. I'm Jewish. I can say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:17:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上你想想 我更像是希特勒的大噩梦\NIn fact, if you think about it, I'm like Hitler's worst nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,此话怎讲？\NAnd why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我 我活得好好的\NLook at me. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还混到了上层 我就是希特勒失败的最终证明\NI did it, I'm on top. I'm the ultimate product of Hitler's defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对 把这句话记下来 都记下来\NYeah, write that down. That was good. Write that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不错 - “希特勒失败的最终证明”\N- Nice one. - "Ultimate product of Hitler's defeat."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你总是那么自信吗？ -一定把那这句放在我照片下面\N- Do you like that confidence? - Put that under a picture of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来谈谈你的出身吧 - 我的出身？\N- Tell us a bit about your background. - My background?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不过说真的 我...我妈死于难产\NNo, but seriously... My mother died in childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.98,0:18:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸就是个没出息的人 我两岁时他就丢下我走了\NMy father was a compulsive loser who abandoned me when I was two years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我被纽约孤儿院来回折腾\NI got stuck in the New York City orphanage system,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,到处被赶来赶去\Ngot shuttled from one hellhole to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 难免有了案底 - 那不是凯·斯通吗？\N- Naturally, got in trouble with the law. - Isn't that Kay Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那破事可不能定义我\NI don't want any of that to define me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,采访呢 采访呢 看什么呢？\NExcuse me. Excuse me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看凯·斯通 - 就是她\N- It's Kay Stone over there. - That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？\NWho's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,三十年代那阵儿的老牌女星\NWell, you know, the movie actress. Like, from the 1930s.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 演《机缘巧合》的那个 - 《机缘巧合》?\N- Opportunities. - Opportunities?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 演得很好 - 是啊 佳片一个\N- That was good. - Yeah, yeah. Great movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有《黑匣子》 - 我爸特喜欢她\N- Black Box. - My dad loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 没错\N- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她当年很红吗？ - 红透半边天\N- She was big? - She was huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,后来销声匿迹了\NCame and went. That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好莱坞就是这样 - 真是她\N- That's Hollywood, mate. - Yeah. It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是她\NIt is indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还有个什么湖的电影\NSomething about a lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 《影湖》 - 嗯 那片也不错\N- Shadow Lake. - Yeah, that was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 身材真好 - 腿不错\N- Pretty. - Great legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮 真漂亮\NGorgeous, mate. Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是在看我吗？ - 不是\N- Think I have a chance, lads? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她肯定在看毛瑟\NI think she's looking Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 下个问题\NNext question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凯吗？ - 有事吗？\N- Kay? - Speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我是马蒂·毛瑟 我住在皇家套房\NHey, it's Marty Mauser. I'm in the Royal Suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨天在大堂见过你\NI saw you in the lobby yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们互相看了一眼 当时我在接受采访\NYeah, we made eye contact. I was being interviewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不记得了 - 这么说吧\N- I don't recall. - Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常仰慕您\NI'm a huge admirer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧 要是没事我就挂了\NOkay. Can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有点事 我刚把客房餐单上每样都点了一份\NMaybe. I just ordered one of everything off the room service menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人肯定吃不完\NThere's no way I'll be able to eat it all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了\NAh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你想让我去你房间？\NSo you'd like me to come up to your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 没错 - 要不我派我丈夫去吧\N- Mm-hmm. Yeah. - Perhaps I should send my husband instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 他来这里 我去你那里\NSure. He can come up here, and I'll come down to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.19,0:19:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真一套套的 行了 再见 - 等等 我还想再说会儿\N- Okay, wonderful. Thank you. Goodbye.- Wait. I wanna keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么？\NWhy is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没跟真正的电影明星说过话\NBecause I've never talked to an actual movie star.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你说过了 希望你如愿以偿了\NWell, now you have. I hope the experience was all you thought it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我其实也会演点戏\NYou know, I'm something of a performer too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.16,0:19:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 是啊 你不信吗？\N- Are you? - Yeah. You don't believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\NI...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么？怎么结巴了？\NYou... What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你会演戏？\NYou're a performer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对 会演 你手边有《每日邮报》吗？\NYeah, I am a performer. You got the Daily Mailin front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.27,0:20:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还真有 怎么了？\NUh, I do have it. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.43,0:20:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那你翻到第12页\NOkay. Well, turn to page 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等下\NUh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,第12页\NPage 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 看什么？\NOkay. What am I looking at here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,看中间 正中间\NDown the middle, in the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那人是你？\NThis is you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对“天选之子” 拍得不错吧？\NYeah, "the chosen one." It's a nice picture, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,打小乒乓的？\NPing pong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.15,0:20:28.33,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（真是天选之子？）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我打的是桌球 来这儿参加英国公开赛\NI play table tennis. I'm here competing in the British Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你多大了？ - 我23\N- How old are you? - I'm 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,才23岁\NTwenty-three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你都说不上来我演过什么吧\NI bet you can't name one film I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.67,0:20:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,凭啥这么肯定？\NWhat makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我在你出生前就不演了\NBecause I stopped acting before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？有点意思 - 嗯\N- Really? That's really interesting. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,凯 你拿我的刮胡刀刮腿毛了吗？\NKay, did you use my razor to shave your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刀钝了 我都划伤了 - 没拿\N- It's dull. I've cut myself. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁在说话？你丈夫？ - 嗯\N- Who's that? Your husband? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,难不成还有人偷偷溜进来用过它？\NI guess someone must've snuck in and chopped wood with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我正打电话呢 - 操\N- I'm on the phone. - Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟谁打？ - 黛比\N- With whom? - Debbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 黛比 - 黛比？\N- Debbie. - Debbie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,叫她少管闲事\NTell her to get a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他走了吗？ - 嗯\N- Is he gone? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,行\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:20:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为啥不演了 说说吧\NSo, why'd you stop acting? Let's talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有事 我得挂了\NYou know, I really have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.43,0:21:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,明天来温布利看我打球吧 你肯定会喜欢的\NYou must miss it, don't you? Come watch me play at Wembley tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我...我去不了\NI... I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 看看我怎么战胜世界第一\NCome on. You can watch me dethrone the number one ranked player in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我没空\NI'm not available.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦哟？你能有什么事？\NOh, yeah? What you got going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有个大宣传会 我得陪我丈夫撑场子\NActually, I have a big promotional event to attend to for my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好吧\NOh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,宣传什么？\NWhat's he promoting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.43,0:21:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,钢笔\NPens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卖笔？开什么玩笑  - 就是笔\N- Pens? Are you serious? - Pens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.70,0:21:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 写字用的钢笔？ - 对\N- Like, writing pens? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是个卖笔的？\NWhat, like, he's a pen salesman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么住得起这种套房？\NHow can you afford the suite you're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他是洛克威尔墨水的老板\NHe owns Rockwell Ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那好吧...\NOh. Okay. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我听说过洛克威尔墨水 - 你肯定知道\N- I know Rockwell Ink. - I'm sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.29,0:21:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那活动内容是什么？\NWell, what's the event?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他请了阿加莎·克里斯蒂去哈查兹书店签名售书\NHe's hired Agatha Christie to sign books at Hatchards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:39.78,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【阿加莎·克里斯蒂为英国知名小说家 哈查兹为伦敦老牌书店】
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 哦\NOoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,听着就无聊\NThat sounds really boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 没完没了了\NOh, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有完没完？ - 别挂 别挂 问你个事\N- What is it? - Don't hang up, don't hang up. Just one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:22:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你房间是朝马路还是朝院子？\NDoes your room face the street or the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\NI don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,直说 马路还是院子？\NJust answer the question. Is it facing the street or the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 朝院子 - 好\N- The courtyard. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.58,0:22:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,去窗边看看\NI need you to go to the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.13,0:22:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你住几楼？\NWhat floor are you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,三楼吧\NI'm on the third floor, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,三楼 好 正好\NThird floor. Okay, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.71,0:22:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,朝对面看看\NLook across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看见对面那开窗 桌上有果盘的屋了吗？\NYou see the open window with a bowl of fruit on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看到了吗？ - 看到了\N- You see it? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看好了 我会让那果盘里凭空多出一个苹果\NHere's what's gonna happen. I'm gonna make an apple appear in that bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我办到了 你就推掉你那场会\NAnd if I do, you're gonna blow off your little rendezvous
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 来看我比赛\N- No, no, no. - and come watch me play.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.25,0:22:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不答应任何事 不行\NI'm not agreeing to anything, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.85,0:22:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用答应 但看好了\NYou don't have to agree to anything. I'm gonna do it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.71,0:22:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了 一\NOkay? One...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.69,0:22:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,二\Ntwo...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.34,0:22:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,三\Nthree.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.09,0:22:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把票留售票处给你取\NI'll leave a ticket for you at the box office.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.98,0:23:07.56,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（半决赛）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.32,0:23:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分\NPoint, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,20比5\NTwenty to five.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱茨基整场落后两局 比分0局比2\NKletzki trails Mauser two games to nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 局点兼赛点\NGame and match point, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:40.42,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【译注：表示马蒂再得一分即可赢下整场比赛】
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.43,0:23:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咱们玩点绝活 - 好吧\N- Let's have a little fun with this one. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玩出花样来 - 收到\N- Have a little fun, all right? - Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.29,0:23:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,换克莱茨基发球\NService switches to Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.79,0:24:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱茨基 得分\NPoint, Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.01,0:24:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 诸位 谢谢大家 谢谢大家\NVery well, gentlemen. Thank you for that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.80,0:24:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱茨基发球 当前局分6比20\NKletzki serves 6-20.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.16,0:24:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟整场领先两局 2局比0\NMauser leads two games to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.86,0:24:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,又是马蒂·毛瑟的赛点\NMatch point again for Mr. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.71,0:24:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,再次由你发球 克莱茨基\NYour service again, Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.07,0:24:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分\NPoint, Mauser!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.39,0:24:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟以21比6赢下此局 以总比分3比0赢下整场比赛\NMauser wins the game and match by 21-6. Three games to nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.69,0:24:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟进入决赛 将对阵日本选手远藤功人\NMauser's on to the finals where he will face Koto Endo of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:03.74,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（菜单）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.67,0:25:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别去看价钱 想吃什么随便点\NGet whatever you want. Don't even look at the prices, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.01,0:25:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你点什么？\NWhat are you getting?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.90,0:25:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我就来个威灵顿牛排和鱼子酱拼盘\NI'm gonna get the Beef Wellington and the caviar tasting plate
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.49,0:25:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要点就点最贵的\Nbecause they're the most expensive items on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.36,0:25:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想再唠叨两句关于巡回表演队的事\NListen, I would like to keep going back a little bit about the Globetrotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.35,0:25:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈林篮球队那事儿？ - 对\N- About the Harlem Globetrotters, again? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.35,0:25:16.70,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【哈林篮球队：美国巡回表演篮球队 擅长花式竞技与表演】
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.95,0:25:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我跟你说过了 我不干 - 为什么？\N- I told you, I'm not interested. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.49,0:25:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就是不想干\N'Cause I don't wanna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.70,0:25:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,报酬很高\NIt's great money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.40,0:25:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们还能环游世界 你不想去威尼斯吗？\NAnd we will travel all over the world. Have you seen Venice?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.81,0:25:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我才不会去当马戏团的中场把戏 - 悉尼呢？\N- I don't wanna be doing trick shots for a halftime show - Sydney?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.83,0:25:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 观众上厕所时上场 - 巴塞罗那？\N- while people are going to the bathroom. - Barcelona?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.46,0:25:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真丢人 明白吗？\NThat's beneath me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.55,0:25:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 观众相当捧他们的 - 服务员在哪儿呢？\N- They're treated like royalty. - Where's the waiter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.59,0:25:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有个熟人干过这行 - 服务员\N- Listen, I know people who have done this. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,服务员\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.41,0:25:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,机会难得 咱们得把握住\NIt's a great opportunity. We should not miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.27,0:25:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂\NMarty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 请问要点什么？\NYes, sir. May I help you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.19,0:25:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,可以点菜了吗？\NHi. Can we order?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.27,0:25:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 我马上去叫这桌的服务员来\NOf course, sir. Let me fetch your waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.73,0:25:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别走 - 请说\N- Hang on. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚洛克威尔的账由我来结\NUh, I'll be taking care of the Rockwell tab tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.34,0:25:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,把账记我房间上 皇家套房 马蒂·毛瑟\NPut it on my room. The Royal Suite. Marty Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟他们交代清楚 是我付的账 - 明白 先生\N- And make sure they know it's me, too. - I will. Leave it to me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.41,0:25:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不许被回绝 - 没问题\N- Don't take no for an answer. - I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.95,0:25:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂·毛瑟 皇家套房 去告诉他们 - 好的 先生\N- Marty Mauser. Royal Suite. Go tell 'em. - Will do, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.27,0:26:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 看着我 别往那儿瞅 看着我\NOkay. Look at me. Don't look there. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.40,0:26:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛克威尔是谁啊 - 就个傻瓜\N- Who's Rockwell? - Some bozo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.90,0:26:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,现在看过去 别太明显 告诉我他在干啥？\NLook over now. Be subtle about it. What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.15,0:26:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉先生 他之前没来过我们酒店\NHe hasn't been here before, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.03,0:26:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他在看这边\NHe's looking at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.04,0:26:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 嗯\N- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.12,0:26:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好 继续跟我说话 别露馅\NOkay, keep talking to me. Be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.62,0:26:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说 再考虑一下\NOkay, fine. I want you to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.66,0:26:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会是绝佳组合 我想跟你搭档\NWe would be a great team. I wanna do this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.45,0:26:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛老想着哈林篮球队？\NWhy are you so fixed on the Harlem Globetrotters?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.37,0:26:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那群人干的真丢人\NIt's very sad what they do, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.43,0:26:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,本该是顶尖的运动员却成了杂耍的小丑\NSome of the premier athletes on the planet reduced to acting like circus clowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.61,0:26:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,再看看什么情况\NWhat's he doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.00,0:26:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他正朝这桌走来 - 他来了？\N- He's coming towards us. - He's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.36,0:26:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别紧张 表现得自然点 - 行 好的 明白\N- Just be normal. Act casual. - Okay, fine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.39,0:26:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,劳驾 我认识你吗？\NExcuse me. Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.41,0:26:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不认识\NI don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.62,0:26:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然想请客？\NAnd you wanna buy dinner for my entire table tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 可以吗？ - 为什么？\N- Yeah. Is it okay? - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.39,0:26:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫为什么？我还需要理由？\NWhat do you mean, why? Do I need a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.82,0:26:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我换个说法 你图什么？\NLet me rephrase that. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.24,0:26:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我什么都不图 只是想表示点谢意\NNo, I don't want anything. It's just my small way of saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.19,0:26:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢我？ - 对\N- Thank you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.97,0:26:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,具体谢我什么？\NThank me for what, specifically?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.39,0:26:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您那些产品\NFor all your products.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.97,0:26:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没了你们的钢笔 世界该怎么办？\NI mean, where would we be without pens?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.45,0:27:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 我有不少本事 但最得意的就是\NYou know, I have many talents, but the one I'm most proud of
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.87,0:27:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能大老远闻出屁话 - 不\N- is the ability to smell bullshit from a mile away. - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.85,0:27:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的都是真心话\NI'm being completely sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是哪儿人？ - 纽约人 你呢？\N- Where are you from? - New York. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.23,0:27:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也是纽约 你是做什么的？\NNew York too. What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.02,0:27:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个职业运动员\NI'm a professional athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.51,0:27:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 哪项运动？ - 桌上网球\N- Really? What sport? - Table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.62,0:27:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,桌上网球？这也算运动？\NTable tennis? That's a sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.07,0:27:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当然算 我来参加英国公开赛的\NOf course it is. I'm here competing in the British Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.99,0:27:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天要在温布利打决赛\NI'm playing at Wembley tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.31,0:27:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对阵日本 明天赛场座无虚席\Nin front of a sold-out crowd in the finals against Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我代表美国出赛 - 等一下\N- I'm here representing the United States. - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.50,0:27:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,日本？日本也来了？\NJapan? Japan has a team here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.10,0:27:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我刚才不是说了吗 - 那出国禁令呢？\N- That's what I just said. - How'd they get around the travel ban?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.21,0:27:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为桌球在亚洲增长最快\NBecause table tennis is the fastest growing sport in Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.51,0:27:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边火得不行\NIt's huge over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.19,0:27:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,说个有意思的事\NOh, you're gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.22,0:27:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他们的握拍法叫什么吗？\NDo you know what they call their grip? The way they hold their rackets?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.64,0:27:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 他们管那叫直笔握拍\N- No. - They call it penholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.64,0:27:40.89,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【直拍：起源日本 英文含“握笔”之意】
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.91,0:27:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样？\NSo what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.72,0:27:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以拿去用\NYou can use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.08,0:27:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,用来干嘛？\NUse it for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去当宣传素材 我哪知道 你才是生意人\NFor an advertisement or something. I don't know, you're the business guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.29,0:27:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有点失礼 这位是我搭档贝拉·克莱茨基\NI'm being rude. This is my associate, Béla Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.50,0:27:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,幸会 先生\NNice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.69,0:27:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是打桌球的？\NI assume you're a table tennis player also?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.90,0:27:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没错 我是三五到三九年的世界冠军\NI am. I am. Actually, I was the World Champion from '35 to '39.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.53,0:27:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,前世界冠军 我今天把他打败了\NHe was the World Champion. I beat him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.19,0:27:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他赢了我 他比我年轻得多\NHe beat me. But he's much younger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.91,0:28:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,也强得多 更有天赋\NI'm much better than him, much more talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到这个纹身 你是不是进过集中营？\NI can't help but notice this tattoo. You were in one of the camps, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.88,0:28:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯威辛二号营区 没错 怎么问这个？\NAuschwitz-Birkenau. Yeah. Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.41,0:28:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子为了解放你们付出了生命\NMy son lost his life liberating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.07,0:28:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\NI'm sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.40,0:28:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为是苏联人解放你们的\NI thought you were liberated by the Soviets.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.24,0:28:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 确实是 是苏联 - 并不是美国人\N- We were. It's Soviets.  - It wasn't the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.81,0:28:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是字面意思 我儿子在太平洋战场\NI didn't mean it literally. He was serving in the South Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.70,0:28:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那他后来怎么了？\NWell, what happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.93,0:28:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还能怎么了 他被杀了\NWhat do you mean? He was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.79,0:28:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这好笑吗？\NYou find that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.96,0:28:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 不是 我有时一紧张就会笑\NOh, God. No, I just get nervous laughter sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.92,0:28:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,说句安慰话\NIf it's any consolation,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.15,0:28:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天会送给他们第三颗原子弹\NI'll be dropping a third atom bomb on their heads tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.74,0:28:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你这套安慰话 顶多忽悠你妈\NYeah, I'm sure his mother's gonna get a lot of comfort
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.76,0:28:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,让她不反对你去打小乒乓\Nthat you're playing ping pong in his honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.64,0:28:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢您操心我家事\NIt's not that big of a deal, but I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.81,0:28:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他讲讲...他以前给纳粹拆弹\NTell him-- He used to diffuse bombs for the Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.45,0:28:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他讲讲那故事\NTell him the story you told me about--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.19,0:28:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我那桌还有人等我 我得走了 - 别走 别走\N- I've got a whole table of people waiting. - No, no, no, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.93,0:28:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他会喜欢的 讲给他听\NYou're gonna love this story. Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想听吗？ - 不太想 但快说吧\N- You wanna hear it? - Not really, but go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.67,0:28:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别停 快说 是好故事\NNo, tell him. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.12,0:28:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,行 那我长话短说\NOkay, I'll make it quick. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.02,0:28:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我进集中营被分配住处的时候\Nwhen I first got to the camp, I was put into housing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.72,0:29:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好有个军官认出我\NLucky for me, there was an officer who recognized me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.64,0:29:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他在1935年布拉格世锦赛上见过我\NHe had seen me in 1935 at the World Championships in Prague.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.33,0:29:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那人是真心崇拜我 真心的\NThis guy was a real fan. I mean, a real fan, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.92,0:29:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他居然因为你会打小乒乓就让你活着？\NYou're telling me he let you live because you played ping pong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.82,0:29:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很佩服我的本事 没错\NThey respected my skills, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.37,0:29:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,于是他们教我拆圆柱高爆炸弹\NSo then, they taught me how to dismantle SC bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.14,0:29:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗？\NOkay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.24,0:29:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,每天早上他们把我和炸弹送到营外的树林里\NEach morning, they would send me into the woods with the bombs
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.83,0:29:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就算炸了也伤不到别人\Non the outskirts of the camp where I could only do damage to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.61,0:29:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有一回\NSo one time,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.88,0:29:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我尾随一只蜜蜂\NI followed a honeybee.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.59,0:29:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么蜂？\NA bee?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,蜜蜂\NA honeybee,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.37,0:29:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一路跟它到了蜂巢\Nall the way to its hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.90,0:29:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我用烟把蜜蜂全都熏跑\NAnd I smoked all the bees out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.99,0:29:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,接着我把巢掰开\NAnd then broke it open,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.52,0:29:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我把蜂蜜抹满全身 胸口 胳膊全抹上了\Nand I smeared the honey all over my chest, my arms, everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.11,0:29:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上回去后\N'Cause later that night,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:30:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我就让室友把我身上的蜜舔掉充饥\NI let all my bunk mates to lick the honey off of me for nourishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.24,0:30:31.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（皇家套房）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.28,0:31:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,正面\NHeads.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.41,0:31:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 操 - 远藤 选什么?\N- Fuck. - Endo, choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.99,0:31:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,发球\NServe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.37,0:31:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我去那头\NI'll go to that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.88,0:32:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 右手边... - 加油 马蒂! 上啊!\N- On my right... - Come on, Marty! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.96,0:32:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...来自美国的马蒂·毛瑟 世界排名第二\N...Marty Mauser of the United States, ranked second,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.63,0:32:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对阵来自日本的远藤功人 无排名\Nversus Koto Endo of Japan, unranked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.10,0:32:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛采取五局三胜制\NThe gentlemen will battle to the best of five
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.35,0:32:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,每局21分\Nin games to 21 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.39,0:32:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,每局须赢至少两分\NEach game shall be won by at least two points.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.69,0:32:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,祝二位好运\NGood luck, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.98,0:32:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,请安静\NQuiet, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.82,0:32:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,开始!\NAll right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.79,0:32:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 远藤 1-0\NPoint, Endo. One-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.38,0:32:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 美国队!\NCome on, America!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.26,0:32:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 远藤 2-0\NPoint, Endo. Two-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.77,0:32:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好球 马蒂!\NAll right, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.60,0:32:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 马蒂!\NCome on, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.44,0:33:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 远藤 3-0\NPoint, Endo. Three-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.16,0:33:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 远藤 4-0\NPoint, Endo. Four-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.34,0:33:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 马蒂!\NCome on, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.09,0:33:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 远藤 5-0\NPoint, Endo. Five-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.06,0:33:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,换毛瑟发球\NService switches to Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.52,0:33:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 毛瑟\NPoint, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.11,0:33:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,9比19发球\NNine serving 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.21,0:34:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 毛瑟 10-19\NPoint, Mauser. 10-19.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.47,0:34:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮 马蒂!\NOkay, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.99,0:34:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 远藤 20-10\NPoint, Endo. 20-10.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.08,0:34:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,局点\NGame point.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.88,0:34:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,发球\NGo! Serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.86,0:35:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 远藤 21-10\NPoint, Endo. 21-10.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.86,0:35:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,本局远藤胜\NGame, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.49,0:35:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤大比分二比零领先\NEndo leads two games to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.41,0:35:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 毛瑟\NPoint, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.46,0:35:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,18-16\NEighteen-16.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.10,0:35:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 毛瑟 17-18\NPoint, Mauser. 17-18.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.27,0:35:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 马蒂! 加油!\NGo, Marty! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.44,0:35:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,换毛瑟发球\NService switches to Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.70,0:36:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,操\NFuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.46,0:36:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 远藤 17-19\NPoint, Endo. 17-19.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.06,0:36:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,操 妈的\NOh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.90,0:36:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 远藤 17-20\NPoint, Endo. 17-20.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.78,0:36:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,赛点\NAnd match point.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.95,0:36:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,请安静\NQuiet, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.62,0:36:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,安静 坐稳了\NQuiet. Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.84,0:36:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,毛瑟发球\NYour service, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.84,0:36:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 马蒂!\NCome on, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.01,0:37:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,操\NFuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.73,0:37:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不行! 狗屁! 不行!\NNo, bullshit! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.64,0:37:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我要立刻重赛 必须用标准硬板拍!\NI want a rematch right now with a standard-league hard-bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.31,0:37:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没法接受!\NThat is unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.52,0:37:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我安只机械手呢?\NWhat if I had a mechanical arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.19,0:37:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在球上抹胶水行不行? 这样合规吗?\NWhat if I put glue on the ball? Would that be kosher?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.32,0:37:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他全程都在接受场外指导! 我没法接受!\NWhy, he was getting coached the entire time! That is unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.45,0:37:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我打的是真刀真枪的乒乓球! 真乒乓球!\NI play real table tennis! Real table tennis!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.49,0:37:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,简直荒唐\NUnbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.00,0:37:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,简直离谱\NUnbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.08,0:37:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...来自日本的全英赛冠军...\N...British Open champion from Japan...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.42,0:37:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,去你妈的!\NFuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.50,0:37:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...远藤功人!\N...Koto Endo!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.48,0:39:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,您这儿有米尔顿 洛克威尔的预约吗?\NDo you have a Milton Rockwell reservation?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.40,0:39:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打扰下?- 麻烦查下米尔顿 洛克威尔的预约\N- Excusez-moi?- Milton Rockwell reservation, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.69,0:39:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 洛克威尔?\NAh, Rockwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.78,0:39:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 马蒂 我想亲口谢你\NSo, listen, Marty, I wanna personally thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.20,0:39:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你带我接触乒乓球\Nfor introducing me to table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.28,0:39:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我压根儿没想到 这玩意在亚洲火成这样\NI had no idea what a phenomenon it was in the Asias.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.95,0:39:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 没错 我知道 - 在日本也大受欢迎!\N- Oh, yeah. I know. - And how big it is in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.79,0:39:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前就想跟你说 场面大得很\NThat's what I was trying to tell you. It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.58,0:39:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我打算把它加入到推广活动里\NSo, I'm thinking of incorporating it into some of the promotional events
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.29,0:39:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,今年秋天我们在那边正好有活动\Nwe're gonna be doing over there in the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.38,0:39:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么弄? 你有什么想法?\NHow so? What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.76,0:39:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想搞一场表演赛\NWhat I wanna do is stage an exhibition match
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.51,0:39:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就在世锦赛期间 让你跟远藤对打\Naround the time of the World Championships between you and Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.18,0:39:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 我想你会喜欢的\N- Mmm. - I think you'd like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.19,0:39:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想给你开个价\NSo I'm gonna make you an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.52,0:39:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一千美元酬劳\NI'll pay you a thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.56,0:39:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,安排你住东京的帝国饭店\NI'll put you up at the Imperial Hotel in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.19,0:39:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你从纽约出发 还可以坐我的私人飞机\NAnd if you're leaving from New York, I'll give you a seat on my private plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.06,0:39:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让你这辈子头一回体验把什么叫奢华\Nand you'll fly in luxury for the first time in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.27,0:40:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,行 价钱晚点再谈\NOkay, we can negotiate my price later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.65,0:40:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是在赛前还是赛后?\NBut this would be before or after the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开赛前一周左右 - 不行 必须是赛后\N- About a week before the event. - No, it's gotta be after.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.20,0:40:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真刀真枪干之前 我不能在公众面前跟他过招\NI can't face off against the guy in public before it actually counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.37,0:40:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我很看重戏剧张力 这种张力不能被削弱\NDrama is very important to me. I can't undercut the drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.89,0:40:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们别纠结这种细节\NLet's not get tied up in minutiae.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.31,0:40:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想确认下 你是否有兴趣参加\NI just want to find out if you're interested in participating.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.25,0:40:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 当然 任何能展示我天赋的机会我都有兴趣\NOh, yeah. Of course. I'm interested in any opportunity to show off my talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.16,0:40:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不用担心 因为这一次我会彻底碾碎他\NAnd you don't have to worry either, 'cause this time I'm gonna obliterate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.98,0:40:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,主要是球拍的问题\NIt's really the racket that I'm playing,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.67,0:40:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但我保证 准能赢\Nbut I can assure you, it's gonna be a victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.30,0:40:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 听着 我得让你明白这是怎么回事\NOkay, listen. I need you to understand what this thing's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.51,0:40:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是正式比赛\NThis is not an official match.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.09,0:40:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,连真球都算不上\NIt's not even a real game.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.84,0:40:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这纯粹是商业推广 为了讨好日本佬\NThis is purely promotional, to entertain the Japanese people,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.01,0:40:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好让他们多买我的笔 懂吗?\Nso they buy more of my pens, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.93,0:40:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你上去打几局 表现出色点\NYou're gonna play a few games. You're gonna be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.65,0:40:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但你不能打得比远藤好 - 你想让我打假球?\N- But you can't play better than Endo. - You want me to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.44,0:40:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 给你看个东西\NMarty, let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.11,0:40:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,日本最大的杂志\NBiggest magazine in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.49,0:40:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让远藤成了国民英雄\NYou made Endo a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.16,0:40:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听着-- - 给我看这个干嘛?\N- Listen-- - Why are you showing me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.45,0:40:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得看了这个我会想输? 这只会让我更想赢\NDo you think this makes me wanna lose? This makes me wanna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.16,0:40:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候 输了才是赢\NSometimes, when you lose you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:40:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听我解释-- - 我比远藤强一万倍\N- Let me explain. Let me explain. - I'm ten trillion times better than Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.46,0:41:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂吧? 我是输在那该死的球拍上\NYou understand that, right? It's the racket that beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.42,0:41:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他就是个平庸球手 - 我一点都不在乎\N- He's a mediocre player. - I couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.13,0:41:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎乒乓球 这是场戏\NI don't care about table tennis. This is theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.34,0:41:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你担心什么? - 我的名声\N- What are you worried about? - My reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.88,0:41:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的名声? - 没错 我的名声\N- Your reputation? - Yes, my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.47,0:41:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想为了你把名声扫地 没门\NI don't wanna throw my reputation in the trash for you. I'm not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.93,0:41:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在不就是在搞那种马戏团式的杂耍吗?\NAren't you playing in a vaudeville circus act right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.60,0:41:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么杂耍? 把话说清楚\NWhat do you mean, vaudeville? Finish that sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.85,0:41:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思? - 你就是个中场余兴节目 马蒂\N- What are you implying? - You're the halftime show, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.15,0:41:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是哈林篮球队! 地球上顶尖的运动员\NOf the Harlem Globetrotters! The finest athletes on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.23,0:41:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从一月到现在 至少有八万观众看过我的表演\NI've probably played in front of 80,000 people since January.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.78,0:41:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这很好笑?\NThat's funny to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.11,0:41:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我觉得你整个人都很滑稽\NNo. You're funny to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.53,0:41:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我滑稽? 知道我觉得什么滑稽吗?\NI'm funny to you? You know what's funny to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.32,0:41:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么低三下四去讨好日本人\NThat you want to entertain the Japanese so badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.33,0:41:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,而他们杀了你儿子 这才叫滑稽\Nand they murdered your son. That's funny to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.00,0:41:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 咱俩互戳了痛点 扯平了 行吗?\NLook, you struck a nerve, I struck a nerve. Okay? Now we're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.05,0:41:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出去\NGet out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.93,0:41:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别啊 你得先把欠我的那顿饭结了\NNah, I think you owe me a meal first.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.73,0:42:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"小星星"!\N"Twinkle Twinkle Little Star"!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.38,0:42:24.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ 每个人终究都要学着长大 ♪\N♪ And everybody's gotta learn sometime ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.76,0:42:31.26,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ 每个人终究都要学着长大 ♪\N♪ Everybody's gotta learn sometime ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.10,0:42:37.27,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,- ♪ 每个人终究都要学着长大 ♪- 漂亮 教练!\N- ♪ Everybody's gotta learn sometime ♪- Yeah, Coach, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.89,0:42:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一 茄子\NThree, two, one. Say cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.02,0:42:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,茄子!\NCheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.54,0:43:07.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ 因为每个人终究都要学着长大 ♪\N♪ 'Cause everybody's Gotta learn sometime ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.30,0:43:13.72,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ 每个人终究都要学着长大 ♪\N♪ Everybody's gotta learn sometime ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.60,0:43:19.56,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ 每个人终究都要学着长大 ♪\N♪ Everybody's gotta learn sometime ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.92,0:43:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰下\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.83,0:43:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHello.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.86,0:44:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别在我房间吃喝 会招虫子\NPlease don't eat or drink in my room. It attracts bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.20,0:44:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我进屋只是为了打扫 仅此而已\NI just go in there to clean. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.42,0:44:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你并不欢迎我\NWell, you don't seem happy to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.25,0:44:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 看来你也不怎么欢迎我\NYeah, and you don't seem happy to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.96,0:44:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你现在打算住这儿吗?\NSo, now are you going to be staying here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.38,0:44:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 不行吗? 别担心\NWhat, is that not okay? Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.01,0:44:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,过几周我就挪窝 不招你烦了\NI'll be out of your hair in a few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.76,0:44:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,别犯傻\NDon't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.89,0:44:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么? 过几周有什么事? - 世锦赛\N- Why? What's in a few weeks? - World Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.51,0:44:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿办? - 东京\N- So, where's that gonna be? - Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.52,0:44:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,日本东京?\NTokyo, Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.94,0:44:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在问我东京是不是在日本吗?\NAre you asking me if Tokyo's in Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.90,0:44:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗?\NIs that a serious question?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.69,0:44:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你累坏了\NYou look very tired to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.65,0:44:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我刚跑了大半个地球 能不累吗\NYeah, 'cause I just traveled halfway around the world. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.28,0:44:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我很忙 忙着工作 忙着搞钱\NI was busy. I was working. I was making money.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.96,0:45:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,趁这楼里的人都在上班\NYou know, while everybody is at work in the building,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.09,0:45:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,正是你舒舒服服洗个热水长澡的好时候\Nit would be a good time for you to take a nice, long, hot shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.42,0:45:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给 - 这是什么?\N- Here. - What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.76,0:45:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我给你带了东西 - 嗯\N- I got you something. - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.44,0:45:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是埃及金字塔上的原件\NIt's from an original Egyptian pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.45,0:45:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是我们建的\NWe built that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.04,0:45:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.43,0:46:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 利维 你长高了不少啊\NHey, Levi. You got a lot taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.51,0:46:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 怎么没有\N- No, I didn't. - Yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.35,0:46:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 找我有事? - 对 跟我走\N- Excuse me. Can I help you? - Yeah. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.94,0:46:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走 赶紧的 - 嘿! 你干嘛?\N- Come on, come on. - Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.52,0:46:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟我走 快走 - 不! 你他妈到底在干嘛?\N- Let's go, let's go. Let's go. - No! What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.81,0:46:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你被捕了 - 我没有!\N- You're under arrest. - No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.19,0:46:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 被捕了 过来 别乱动! - 凭什么逮捕我?\N- Yes, you are. Come here. Stop moving! - What am I under arrest for?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.23,0:46:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是我的洗漱用品! 噢! - 你被捕了\N- That's my toiletries! Ow! - You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 犯了什么事? - 持械抢劫 走吧\N- For what? - Armed robbery. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.49,0:46:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,持械抢-- 你胡说什么呢?\NArmed rob-- What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.82,0:46:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再乱动就要伤着你自己了!\NYou're gonna hurt yourself if you keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.24,0:46:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到底怎么回事? - 走\N- What is going on? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.32,0:46:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 默里 我妈在哪? 默里 - 我让她先出去待会儿\N- Murray, where's my mother? Murray. - I asked her to leave for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.99,0:46:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你让她-- 到底他妈怎么回事? 我要被抓了! 救我!\NYou told her-- What the fuck is going on? I'm getting arrested! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.21,0:46:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,萨尔 萨尔 我想跟他单独谈谈 麻烦了 先走吧\NSal, Sal. I wanna talk to him in private. Excuse us. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.87,0:46:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 萨尔? 你认识这人? - 要我怎么做?\N- Sal? You know this guy? - What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.38,0:46:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先去后面待会儿 - 行\N- Just go in the back for a while. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.04,0:46:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,关上门\NClose the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.25,0:46:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,行 要是闹起来了就喊一声\NAll right, if it gets crazy just holler.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.05,0:46:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,到底他妈怎么回事 默里? 我拿的那笔钱是你欠我的\NWhat the fuck is going on, Murray? That money I took, you owed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.68,0:46:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 那是你持枪抢走的钱\NNo, no, no, no. It was money you stole at gunpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.80,0:46:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 你答应过我... 抱歉 - 不 你根本没...\N- No, you promised me... Excuse me. - No, you didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.85,0:46:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的钱 结果你拿走了--\NThat was my money and you took--
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.76,0:46:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应过要把那笔钱给我的 我没... 我干嘛要编瞎话?\NYou promised me that money. I'm not... Why would I make this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.14,0:46:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是去英国的路费 - 你那趟旅行怎么着了?\N- It was money for my trip to England. - What happened on your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.60,0:46:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫怎么着了?\NWhat do you mean, what happened on my trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.06,0:46:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你输了! - 我没输!\N- You lost! - No, I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.19,0:46:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你就是输了! - 从哪儿听说的?\N- You did! - Where did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.73,0:46:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 我是被耍了 - 你知不知道有多少次\N- No, I got cheated against. - Do you know how many times
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.40,0:46:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在大半夜里... - 行了 别扯淡了\N- in the middle of the night... - No, no. Stop with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.15,0:47:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 听我说! - 少教训我\N- Shut up and listen to me! - Don't lecture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.11,0:47:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴!\NShut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.74,0:47:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道我被吵醒过多少次去保释你\NYou don't know how many times I had to get woken up and bail you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.16,0:47:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么时候求你干过那事?\NWhen did I ask you to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.37,0:47:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我什么时候找你帮过忙? - 你确实没求过我\N- When have I ever asked for your help? - You never asked me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.41,0:47:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是啊! - 但我还是做了\N- Exactly! - But I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.75,0:47:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 你得像个大人样了\NAnd now, you're gonna be a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.54,0:47:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 轮到你了 - 像个大人样?\N- It's your turn. - A big boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.04,0:47:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真跟我这么说话? - 没错 听着...\N- Did you really just say that to me? - Yeah. Yeah, you know, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.71,0:47:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可能养你妈一辈子\NI can't support your mother for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.46,0:47:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不用养 - 噢 是吗? 凭什么?\N- You're not gonna have to. - Oh, yeah? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.22,0:47:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为我要承担起来了 - 你承担? 怎么承担?\N- Because I'm gonna step up. - You're gonna step up? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.59,0:47:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你没法想象 她会住在第五大道\NIn a way you can't imagine. She's gonna be living on Fifth Avenue
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.85,0:47:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,住在有电梯的高档公寓里\Nin an apartment and building with a elevator,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.64,0:47:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,还有专门开电梯的人 随叫随到\Nand a man who works in the elevator that takes her every time she needs to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.43,0:47:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 行了 听着\NSure, sure, sure. All right, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.39,0:47:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你两个选择 行吗?\NI'm gonna give you two options, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.48,0:47:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你会喜欢第一个\NI think you'll like the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.52,0:47:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你回店里上班\NYou come back to the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.19,0:47:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这回 别再扯淡了\NThis time, no more bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.74,0:47:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别再搞这些乒乓球的荒唐事了 行吗?\NNone of this ping-pong mishegoss, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.57,0:47:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你更大的权责\NI'm gonna give you much more responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.53,0:47:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,因为说实话 你是个了不起的推销员\Nbecause truth be told, you're an amazing salesman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.04,0:47:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我能把鞋卖给残疾人\NI could sell shoes to an amputee.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.83,0:47:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样? 另一个选择呢?\NSo what? What's the other option?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.75,0:47:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我控告你\NI press charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.21,0:47:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛伊是证人... - 你不会那么干的\N- Lloyd is a witness... - You're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.34,0:47:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...你得去蹲大牢!\N...and you go to jail!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.42,0:47:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真的? 对你亲外甥这么狠? 你疯了吗?\NReally? You'd do that to your own kin? Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.76,0:48:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走着瞧... 这是自作自受 - 嘿 萨尔! 萨尔!\N- We'll see... You took it upon yourself. - Hey, Sal! Sal!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.80,0:48:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干嘛? - 他现在给你开多少钱?\N- What? - How much is he paying you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.76,0:48:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么 给我开钱?\NWhat are you talking about, paying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.26,0:48:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我舅舅花多少钱雇你来吓唬我?\NHow much is my uncle paying for you to scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.89,0:48:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不管多少 我出双倍让你给我跪下舔干净\N'Cause whatever it is, I'll double it for you to suck my dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.31,0:48:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 给我舔\N- What? - Suck my dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.02,0:48:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你口臭太他妈难闻了 - 嘴放干净点 你这--\N- You have terrible breath. - Watch your mouth, you--
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.44,0:48:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢! 操! - 走 咱们现在就走\N- Ow! Fuck! - Let's go. We're going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.52,0:48:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他刚才打我! - 住手 拜托停下\N- He just hit me! - Stop. Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.48,0:48:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 默里 他打我 - 停下\N- Murray, he hit me. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.61,0:48:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都商量好了\NWe worked everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.36,0:48:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你在别的屋子 没听见 我们已经谈妥了\NYou were in the other room. You didn't hear. We already worked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.61,0:48:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他会赔偿一切 - 畜生\N- He's paying back everything. - Animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.20,0:48:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他把钱给我了 万事大吉\NHe gave me the money, and everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.37,0:48:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你从哪弄来的? - 我从你行李箱里拿的\N- Where did you get that? - I got it from your luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.24,0:48:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗? 那是我去日本的钱!\NAre you out of your mind? That's my money for Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.41,0:48:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你他妈疯了吗? - 走 赶紧走\N- Are you out of your fucking mind? - Let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.08,0:48:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,就把他带去市局 妈的! 带他走!\NJust take him downtown, damn it! Take him downtown!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.42,0:48:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行了 好了! 我不闹了! - 你玩完了 彻底完了\N- Okay. All right! Okay! I'll stop! - You're done. You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.88,0:48:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托 停下 住手 - 跟我走\N- Please. Stop. Stop. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.38,0:48:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行了 放他走 放开他 - 放他走?\N- All right. Let him go. Let him go. - Let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.71,0:48:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放开他 让他走 - 坐好\N- Let him go. Let him go. - Sit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.26,0:48:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 道个歉\NListen, apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.10,0:48:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,行 抱歉 我错了\NOkay, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.22,0:48:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,给他解开手铐\NTake his cuffs off.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.27,0:48:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咱们接下来的打算 听好了? - 行\N- This is what's gonna happen, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.48,0:48:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们去花园咖啡馆见你妈\NWe're gonna meet your mom at the Garden Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.65,0:49:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们好好吃顿饭\NWe're gonna have a really nice dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.86,0:49:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,之前的破事儿就翻篇了 行吗?\NAnd let's just put all this shit behind us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.15,0:49:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,行 没问题\NOkay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.24,0:49:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我错了 我错了 真心对不住 - 你知错了?\N- I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I'm sorry. - You're sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.82,0:49:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的事儿咱们去解决 赶紧穿衣服\NWe'll take care of everything. Just get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.87,0:49:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 舅舅爱你 - 行 我也爱你\N- Come on. I love you. - All right. I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.20,0:49:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你那外甥就是坨狗屎 你知道吧?\NYour nephew's a piece of shit, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.21,0:49:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天呐 实在对不住\NOh, Jesus. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.96,0:49:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿再给你十块\NHere another ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.88,0:49:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,行 没问题\NYeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.75,0:49:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,花园咖啡馆? 你都点什么?\NGarden Café, huh? What do you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.51,0:49:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,熏牛肉啊 还能有什么?\NThe pastrami, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.18,0:49:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 熏牛肉 - 你点什么?\N- Ah, pastrami. - What do you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.72,0:49:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,烤牛肉\NRoast beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.80,0:49:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 烤牛肉? - 昂\N- Roast beef? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.14,0:49:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,外行条子!\NGoyishecop!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.15,0:49:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.23,0:49:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,开门 赶紧的\NOpen up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.61,0:49:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把它撞开 - 冲进去?\N- Break it down. - Break it in?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.95,0:49:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,操!\NFuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.49,0:49:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 你往哪跑?\NHey! Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.41,0:49:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.29,0:49:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了? - 他跳窗跑了\N- What happened? - He went out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.91,0:49:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? 等等! - 弗兰基!\N- What? Wait! - Frankie!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.33,0:50:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 他正顺着消防梯往下爬呢\N- What? - He's coming down the escape right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.21,0:50:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那儿! 顺着消防梯下去了!\NThere he goes! Down the escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.34,0:50:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 操 - 追 追 追!\N- Oh, shit. - Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.86,0:50:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去后头打个电话 - 拿稳了\N- I'm just gonna use the phone in the back. - You hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.37,0:50:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧见他有多喜欢你了吗?\NSee how much he likes you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.62,0:50:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂?- 嘿 沃利 怎么样? 我是马蒂\N- Hello?- Hey, Wally. How you doing? It's Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.08,0:50:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 今晚出车吗? - 废话 当然出\N- Are you working tonight? - Of course I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.09,0:50:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,行 太棒了 带着车 尽可能多带点现金\NOkay, great. Bring your cab and as much cash as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.21,0:50:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,到28街的海尔西找我 听明白没?\NI want you to meet me at The Halsey on 28th Street, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.67,0:50:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 你又想去混场子了?\NWhat? You wanna go hustling again?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.01,0:50:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 正是这意思\NYeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.18,0:50:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 上回我被虐惨了\NNo, no, no. I got my ass kicked last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.01,0:50:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们大老远跑去斯塔滕岛\NWe went all the way to Staten Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.43,0:50:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,结果十分钟不到 他们就认出你来了\Nand within ten minutes, they recognized you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.98,0:51:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 咱们去昆提过的新泽西那地儿\NIt's fine. We're gonna go to that place that Quinn was talking about in Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.89,0:51:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不是什么好主意\NThat's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.02,0:51:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是你的新宠物 - 不 妈 我想要犰狳\N- That's your new pet. - No, Mom, I want the armadillo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.40,0:51:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我已经--\NNo, I already--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.48,0:51:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗? 我就给你买那只犰狳\NYou know what? I'm just gonna get you the armadillo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.36,0:51:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它给你 然后你自己决定 行吗?\NI'm gonna give him to you, and then you can make a decision. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.32,0:51:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,它们不是爬行动物 是哺乳动物\NThey're not reptiles. They're mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.61,0:51:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,行 太棒了 你真是个好人 一个半小时后见\NOkay, great. You're a beautiful man. I'll see you in an hour and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.12,0:51:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哪儿?- 海尔西 就这样 爱你\N- Where?- At the Halsey. Okay. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.58,0:51:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 拜\NThank you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.33,0:51:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 给你\NGood. Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.41,0:51:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 有后门或者别的小道能走吗?\NIs there a way I can go out the back or something, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.71,0:51:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛? 你干嘛这么看着我?\NWhat? Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.59,0:51:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你就不打算跟我说点什么吗?\NAren't you gonna say something to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.59,0:51:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么 恭喜吗?\NWhat, congratulations?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.55,0:51:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 恭喜? - 对\N- Congratulations? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.51,0:51:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你开玩笑吗? - 你想让我说什么?\N- Are you kidding me? - What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.14,0:51:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我找了你整整八个月\NI've been trying to get in contact with you for eight months.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.14,0:51:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你想干嘛 没用的\NI see what you're trying to do. It's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.93,0:51:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么? - 那种不是我的\N- Excuse me? - That's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.18,0:51:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 绝对是你的 - 不可能 我都是拔出来的\N- It is absolutely yours. - No, it's not. I pull out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.60,0:51:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,艾拉也拔出来吗?\NDoes Ira pull out?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.02,0:51:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想让我怎么回? - 很简单的问题\N- What do you want me to say to that? - It's a simple question.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.02,0:51:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟你干那事儿的时候也拔出来吗?\NDoes he pull out when he has sex with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.56,0:51:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回答我 - 你非要我回答这个?\N- Answer it. - You want me to answer that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.94,0:51:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,对! 回答我! 他在那什么的时候...\NYes! Answer it. Does he pull out when he...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.61,0:51:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起 对不起\NI'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.70,0:51:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在一团糟 瑞秋 真的乱透了\NI'm a mess right now. I'm really a mess, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.66,0:51:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说下 我在伦敦输了--\NI lost in London, by the way--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.24,0:51:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.37,0:52:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\NGod.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.58,0:52:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是干嘛?\NWhat's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.96,0:52:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他爸爸过世了\NHis father died.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.51,0:52:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 扯淡! - 她是我八岁就认识的朋友\N- Bullshit! - This is my friend since I was eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.47,0:52:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我在跟你说话吗?\NAm I talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.59,0:52:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,艾拉 我八岁就认识她了\NIra, I've known her since I was eight years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.43,0:52:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸刚走 她在安慰我\NMy father just died. She was consoling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.85,0:52:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 没事\NHoney, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.43,0:52:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴! 别碰我! - 你就这么跟老婆说话?\N- Shut up! Don't touch me! - That's how you talk to your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.14,0:52:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我就这么跟她说话\NYeah, that's how I talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.98,0:52:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,行\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.06,0:52:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别 别! 来啊 继续说\NNo, no, no! Come on. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.73,0:52:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 继续啊 - 马蒂 算了 别说了\N- Keep going. - Marty, just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.11,0:52:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把他脑门上那条他妈的一字眉给撕了!\NI'll rip that unibrow right off his fucking forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.99,0:52:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你想动手? 跟个大猩猩似的?\NYou wanna get physical? Like an ape?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.66,0:52:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,艾拉\NIra.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.87,0:52:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,艾拉! 快回来 你干嘛呢?\NIra! Come back inside. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.41,0:52:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谁快去他妈的把条子叫来?\NSomebody get the fucking cops over here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.67,0:52:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你干了什么? - 操! 我得闪人了\N- What did you do? - Fuck! I gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.67,0:52:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你跑什么? 条子追你干嘛?\NWhy are you running from the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.92,0:52:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 他就在这儿!\NCome on, he's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.34,0:52:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没后门能溜吗?\NThere's no way out the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.84,0:52:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? 什么-- - 拜托! 快点 瑞秋! 精神点\N- What? What-- - Please! Come on. Rachel! Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.38,0:52:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,通往后院 走\Nit leads out the back. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.84,0:52:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,行 行 谢谢 谢谢\NOkay. Okay. Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.39,0:52:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,回头再跟你说 回头再说\NI'll tell you later. I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.33,0:53:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哥几个 见着个戴眼镜的白人小子打这儿路过吗?\NGuys, you see a white kid with glasses come through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.13,0:53:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没人看见他?\NNobody saw him?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.22,0:53:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,听不懂英语 昂?\NNo English, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.68,0:53:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如需继续通话 请投币五分\NPlease insert a nickel if you'd like to continue the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.05,0:53:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,五分? 电话要断了\NA nickel? They're gonna cut us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.22,0:53:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有五分吗? - 没\N- Do you have a nickel? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.64,0:53:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 我没撒谎 我保证这是最后一次\NMom, I'm not lying. I promise you this will be the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.27,0:53:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我眼瞎了吗 那是他妈的"小老鼠"?\NAre my eyes broke, or is that motherfucking Mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.02,0:53:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢了 - 怎么着 宝贝?\N- Thank you. - What's up, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.19,0:53:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,太谢谢了 真是帮大忙了 谢谢\NThank you so much. I really appreciate it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.32,0:53:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 你闻着像股鱼腥味\NYou smell like a fish, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.61,0:53:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,所以咱们得开个房 我得洗个澡\NThat's why we gotta get a hotel room. I need to get a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.82,0:53:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 哥们 弄个房间 行吗?\NHow you doing? Hey, can we get a hotel room, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.61,0:53:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四块钱 - 你刚还说三块呢\N- Four dollars. - You said it was three dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.24,0:54:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是上个房间的价格 现在四块 - 怎么现在变四块了?\N- That was for the last room. It's four. - Why is it four dollars now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.24,0:54:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,借我四块 我保证还你\NLet me get four bucks. I'll pay you back, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.91,0:54:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我丑话说在前 咱们一共就十块本钱\NI'm telling you right now, we only got ten to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.83,0:54:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你就带了十块?\NYou brought ten dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.91,0:54:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你才提前一小时通知我 - 那咱们怎么赢钱?\N- You gave me a hour notice. - How are we supposed to make money?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.21,0:54:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我得养娃呢! 我就是个操蛋的出租车司机\NI got kids! I'm a fucking taxi driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.50,0:54:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有便宜点的房吗? 差点儿没事\NDo you have a cheaper room? It doesn't have to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.34,0:54:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,五楼有一间 但不能洗澡\NThere's a room on the fifth floor, but you can't use the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.80,0:54:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行 那个多少? - 两块五\N- Okay, how much is that? - Two fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.38,0:54:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拿三块给我 谢谢\NLet me get three dollars. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.18,0:54:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好还我 算你走运 我还拿你当哥们\NYou better pay me back. You lucky I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.97,0:54:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吉米 吉米 - 待会从赢的钱里扣\N- Jimmy. Jimmy. - It's coming out your winnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.05,0:54:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙给我\NGive me the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.14,0:54:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什么味儿?\NWhat's that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.47,0:54:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我的天! 操\NOh, my God! Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.48,0:54:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇! 那是什么? - 噢 我的天!\N- Wow! What is that? - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.31,0:54:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他出了点小意外\NHe had a little accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.85,0:54:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐! 他拉了个大的\NGod! He had an enormous accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.69,0:54:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,太恶心了\NThat's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.32,0:54:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闻着像坨屎! - 操!\N- Smells like shit! - Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.73,0:54:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米 你臭得像坨屎\NJimmy, you smell like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.19,0:54:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是你口臭还是那狗臭? - 能把钥匙给我了吗?\N- Is that your breath or the dog? - Can I get my key, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.49,0:54:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别带着那狗进电梯 走楼梯\NDo not go in the elevator with that dog. Take the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.07,0:54:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟我开玩笑呢? - 给那狗洗洗\N- Are you kidding me? - Wash that dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.62,0:54:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 吉米\NGoodbye, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.70,0:54:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她肚子多大了 马蒂? - 很大 挺大的\N- How big is she, Marty? - Very big. Big.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.66,0:54:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,明天就生吗?\NIs she popping out tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.79,0:54:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪知道什么时候生 听着 我只知道孩子不是我的\NI don't know when she's popping out. Look, all I know is it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.13,0:54:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她有阴谋 你不像我这么了解她\NShe has an agenda. You don't know her like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.71,0:54:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她困在一段操蛋的婚姻里 生活过得一塌糊涂\NShe's stuck in a miserable marriage. She has a horrible life.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.71,0:54:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是想赖在我头上\NShe's trying to pin it down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.80,0:54:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,从咱们八岁起 她就想把我套牢\NSince we were eight years old, she's trying to get me stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.59,0:55:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就为了套你这穷光蛋? - 没错\N- Your bummy ass? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.18,0:55:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,也是 她确实疯\NYeah, she is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.30,0:55:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子从生物学上讲 绝不可能是我的 行吗?\NIt's a biological impossibility that that kid is mine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.76,0:55:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以 你带"雨衣"了? - 没 我不需要\N- So, you using raincoats? - No, I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.81,0:55:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那你的子弹肯定是哑的\NSo you must be shooting blanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.60,0:55:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么叫憋尿吗 沃利? 不知道?\NDo you know what continence is, Wally? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.31,0:55:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,每次我撒尿的时候 我都会憋住\NEvery time I take a piss, I pull back,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.69,0:55:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,憋住 默数到十个数\NI hold my urine in, and I count to ten Mississippi.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.94,0:55:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,锻炼肌肉就得靠这个\NThat's how you build up the muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.19,0:55:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你那是他妈的找膀胱炎呢\NThat's how you get a fuckin' bladder infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.61,0:55:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛呢? 那是我的信\NWhat are you doing? That's my mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.70,0:55:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗?\NAre you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.74,0:55:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你得去买那些该死的尿布\NYou need to grab them goddamn diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.28,0:55:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不去\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.37,0:55:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,给我清醒点\NAnd get a fucking grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.70,0:55:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不当什么爹\NI'm not a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.14,0:55:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哟 马蒂 - 怎么?\N- Yo, Marty. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.39,0:55:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,丽兹酒店是哪出?\NWhat's the Ritz?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.48,0:55:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛?\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.56,0:55:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你收到一张1500美元的罚单\NYou got a $1,500 fine
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.02,0:55:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,国际乒联发来的...\Nfrom the International Table Tennis...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.15,0:55:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啥? - ...说是协会要...\N- What? - ...Association and...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.77,0:55:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还要... - 拿进来给我!\N- And they... - Bring it in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.86,0:56:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还要把你这弱鸡给禁赛了 - 拿给我\N- And they banned your scrawny ass. - Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.36,0:56:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈怎么回事?\NWhat the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.12,0:56:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 你他妈又是谁?\N- Are you okay? - Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.49,0:56:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐! 救命! 把这鬼玩意儿从我身上挪开!\NGod! Help me! Get this fucking thing off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.46,0:56:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我的狗!\NMy dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.04,0:56:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 操! - 见鬼! 发生什么了?\N- Holy shit! - Shit! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.42,0:56:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快点! 从那破浴缸里滚出来帮帮我!\NCome on! Get outta that fuckin' tub and help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.22,0:56:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我的狗快淹死了 伙计 快啊! 帮帮我!\NMy dog's drowning, man. Come on! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.05,0:56:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,行 我把它翻过来 把手抽出来\NOkay, I'm flipping it. Take your arm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.60,0:56:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一 二 - 把它抬开!\N- One. Two. - Lift it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.10,0:56:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,三\NThree.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.77,0:56:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快把手抽出来! 噢我的天! 我的天!\NTake your arm out! Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.81,0:56:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,操! 操!\NFuck! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.94,0:56:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 妈的 你的手\NOh, fuck, your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.90,0:56:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,往后靠 往后靠 别看伤口\NLean back. Lean back. Don't look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.07,0:56:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我得弄个止血带 - 噢 操!\N- I need to make a tourniquet. - Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.78,0:56:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 过来 手给我 - 你要干嘛?\N- Come here. Give me your arm. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.36,0:56:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你干什么? - 手给我\N- What are you doing? - Give me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.70,0:56:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈的 - 我的狗呢?\N- Fuck. - Where's my dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.16,0:56:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别管那狗了! 手给我\NDon't worry about the dog! Give me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.58,0:56:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 摩西 - 别乱动 别乱动\N- Moses. - Do nothing. Do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.83,0:56:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有我在呢 别担心\NI got you. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.29,0:56:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 快叫救护车!\NWally, call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.29,0:56:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧? - 不 我一点也不好\N- Are you good? - No, I'm not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.54,0:56:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我的眼镜呢?\NWhere are my glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.63,0:57:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是问你伤着没? 你刚把地板砸穿了\NI mean, are you hurt? You just fell through the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.50,0:57:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真他妈扯淡 我得把钱要回来\NFucking horseshit. I'm getting our money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.67,0:57:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱要回来?\NGetting our money back?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.47,0:57:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 咱们得赶紧溜 这才两块五毛钱 你在说啥呢?\NMarty, we gotta get the fuck out of here. It's $2.50. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.30,0:57:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回来的可不止两块五 你没见刚才发生了什么?\NI'm asking for way more than $2.50. You see what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.52,0:57:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在这等着 等着\NWait here. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.56,0:57:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等多久? - 十秒钟\N- For how long? - Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.44,0:57:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我的鞋 我的衣服\NMy shoes, my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.52,0:57:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,全湿透了 里面乱成一团\NEverything's soaking wet. It's a mess in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.69,0:57:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你给我闭嘴吧 - 你想练练?\N- Why don't you put a sock in it? - You wanna switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.28,0:57:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你! 我... 我早说了别用他妈的喷淋\NYou! I... I told you not to use the fucking shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.24,0:57:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你才没说 是你把房租给我的 懂吗?\NNo, you didn't. You're the one that rented me the room, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.83,0:57:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我从天花板掉下来差点摔断脖子\NI could have broken my neck falling out of that ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.16,0:57:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的现在也还没准能摔断呢\NThat can fucking still happen too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.79,0:57:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你现在是在威胁我吗? - 对 没错\N- Are you threatening me right now? - Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.33,0:57:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 居然敢威胁我? - 对\N- You want to threaten me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.50,0:57:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 地下室锁了! - 谁拿的他妈的钥匙?\N- Basement is locked! - Who's got the fucking key?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.33,0:57:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 哥们! 听好了! 我要把房钱拿回来...\NListen, man! Listen! I want my money for my room...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.17,0:57:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救护车来了 - ...我还要赔偿\N- Ambulance. - ...and I want a reimbursement
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.71,0:57:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我那些毁了的破烂儿 - 认真的吗?\N- for my shit that got ruined. - Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.09,0:57:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你那些破玩意儿一个子儿也拿不回来\NYou're not gonna get your shit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.30,0:57:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 七块五! - 你什么也别想拿\N- $7.50! - You'll get nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.34,0:57:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 帮帮我! - 医护人员来了\N- Come on. Help me! - Paramedics.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.59,0:57:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 你们可来了 - 病人在哪儿?\N- Good, you're here. - Where's the patient at?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.05,0:57:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,在那儿 手臂受伤了 流了好多血\NHe's in here. It's his arm. He's lost a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.89,0:57:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.35,0:57:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 浴缸砸他身上了 - 浴缸砸他身上了?\N- Bathtub fell on him. - Bathtub fell on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.23,0:57:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我手没知觉了\NI can't feel my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.69,0:57:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 吉米 拜托 帮我把这狗弄走\NYo, Jimmy. Come on, you gotta help me with this dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.81,0:58:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我这儿没人手 - 得送它去兽医那儿\N- I don't got nobody free. - We gotta get him to the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.02,0:58:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我现在真腾不出人手 - 它是我的家人 哥们\N- I got nobody free right now. - He's my family, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.44,0:58:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 把两块五还我 我就走 七块五不要了\NListen, now. Just give me the $2.50, and I'll get outta here. Forget the $7.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.53,0:58:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把两块五给我就行 - 我帮不了你\N- Just give me $2.50. - I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.86,0:58:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,明天找老板去\NSee the owner tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.03,0:58:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小子 - 都是因为这破旅馆的烂天花板\N- Kid. - It's your shitty ceiling
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.12,0:58:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给闹的 - 小子 噢!\N- in this crummy hotel. - Kid. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.08,0:58:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我什么都不会给你 - 什么?\N- I ain't giving you nothing. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.16,0:58:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 拜托 把狗送去兽医那儿\NKid. Come on. Just bring the dog to the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.66,0:58:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我得工作 有活要干\NI can't. I got work. I got a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.46,0:58:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能被开除 - 你有工作?\N- I can't get fired. - You got a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.58,0:58:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我出双倍工钱 - 不 行不通 不行\N- I'll give you double what you're getting. - No, I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.75,0:58:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我给三倍 来吧\NI'll give you triple. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.96,0:58:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 悠着点 冷静下 - 行吧\N- Take it easy. Calm down. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.42,0:58:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,行 翻下那个包 看到椅子上的包了吗?\NOkay, look in that bag. See the bag on the chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.59,0:58:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对 翻那个包 把它打开\NYeah, go in that bag, okay? Open it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.55,0:58:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我得给你上个止血带\NI'm gonna apply a tourniquet to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.14,0:58:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我这就把原来那个撤了\NI'm gonna remove the other tourniquet right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.97,0:58:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,拿五十给你自己 没错\NTake 50 for yourself. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.10,0:58:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,再带五十给兽医 明白吗?\NBring 50 for the vet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.31,0:58:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,血都喷出来了\NWe got blood squirting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.56,0:58:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他在13街和1大道交口\NHe's on 13th and 1st.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.10,0:58:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他我一完事就赶过去 懂吗?\NAnd tell him I'll be there as soon as I can get there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.77,0:58:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然要给这混蛋钱?\NYou're gonna give this motherfucker money?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.82,0:58:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是他他妈让浴缸砸到你身上的\NHe's the one who fuckin' dropped the tub on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.65,0:58:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过他别进那个破浴缸的\NI told him not to get in the fuckin' bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.36,0:58:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真他妈讲究 小子\NFucking mensch, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.91,0:58:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,担架准备好了吗? 咱们送他去贝尔维尤\NStretcher ready? We'll take him to Bellevue.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.57,0:58:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真他妈讲究\NFucking mensch.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.66,0:58:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们现在掉头还来得及\NWe can still turn around
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.99,0:58:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能送他去兽医那儿 - 不行 不行\N- and take him to the vet. - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.83,0:58:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五十块钱绰绰有余了 - 知道什么比五十块更好吗? 一百块\N- Fifty dollars is more than enough. - You know what's better than 50? 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.92,0:59:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有一百块本钱 咱们能赢个盆满钵满\NWe can clean house with a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.38,0:59:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别贪得无厌了 你这该死的犹太佬\NDon't be greedy, you fucking Jew.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.00,0:59:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 是1500美元的罚款 是你拿给我看的\NNo, no. It's a $1,500 fine. You're the one that showed it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.92,0:59:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说下 咱们得连续两周每晚都这么干\NBy the way, we gotta do this every night for two weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.09,0:59:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 否则我就去不了日本了 - "咱们"? 噢 不不不\N- or else I can't go to Japan. - "We"? Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.68,0:59:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想因为你捅了娄子就两周不去上班\NI'm not taking two weeks off work 'cause you fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.97,0:59:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 拿着这个 伙计\NHey. Take this, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.05,0:59:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着 没错 好孩子\NTake this. There you go. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.68,0:59:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,把这混蛋的项圈松一松 伙计\NLoosen up the collar on this motherfucker, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.35,0:59:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行了 - 他听着像个破暖气片\N- All right. - He sound like a radiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.19,0:59:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们先去打球\NWe're gonna go play,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.27,0:59:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,回来的路上再送他去兽医那儿\Nwe'll drop him off at the vet on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.77,0:59:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耽搁两小时对他算得了什么? - 马蒂 我都约好车了 伙计\N- What's a couple of hours to this guy? - Marty, I got rides set up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.94,0:59:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,唉 摩西\NHuh. Moses.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.79,0:59:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,三号球道 归你了\NLane three. That's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.76,0:59:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 怎么样? - 有什么能帮您的?\N- Hi, how you doing? - Could I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.56,0:59:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,能给我开个球道吗?\NCan I get a lane?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.52,1:00:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大概得等半小时 四十分钟\NProbably gonna be a half hour, 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.52,1:00:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 你确定能等?\N- That's okay. - You all right with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.69,1:00:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要租鞋吗? - 我待会儿再拿\N- You want shoes? - I'll just grab 'em later.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.37,1:00:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定 结束\NDone. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.37,1:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,弱得可怜 给钱\NFucking pathetic. Pay up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.24,1:00:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谁想打下一局?\NWho wants next?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.45,1:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我能打吗? 嘿! 我能来一局吗?\NCan I play? Hey! Can I play?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.46,1:00:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一块钱一局 - 行吧\N- It's a dollar a game. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.25,1:00:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么? - 塞思\N- What's your name? - Seth.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.96,1:00:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,来几个对攻热热身吧\NLet's get a warm-up rally going.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.67,1:00:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不 要打就掏钱 否则闭嘴 我不打白工\NNah. Put up or shut up. I don't play for free.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.17,1:00:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧 没听过这规矩\NAll right. Never heard of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.59,1:00:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我押钱 - 他管账\N- I'm holding. - He's holding.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.88,1:00:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你管账? 凭什么是他管?\NYou're holding? Why is he holding?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.05,1:00:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你带钱了吗? - 我能信任你吗?\N- Have you got yours? - Can I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.09,1:00:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,信任我 绝对没问题\NTrust me, you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.76,1:00:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 战况如何? - 好了 塞思对阵罗杰\N- Where are we at? - All right, Seth vs. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.97,1:00:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一块钱一局\NDollar game.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.64,1:00:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我发球\NI serve.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.94,1:00:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛呢? 我看都没看\NWhat are you doing? I'm not even looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.52,1:00:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 1比0 - 我刚才看都没看\N- One-zip. - I wasn't even looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.40,1:00:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你不能那么干 - 啥?\N- No, you can't do that. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.91,1:00:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你得让球落到对面\NYou gotta let the ball hit the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.45,1:00:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能用球拍接球 我得分\NYou can't catch it with your paddle. My point.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.74,1:00:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么呢? - 你不能那么干\N- What are you talking about? - You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.20,1:01:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你得让球掉下桌子才行\NYou gotta let the ball fall off the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.74,1:01:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 荒谬至极 - 你在耍赖\N- That's ridiculous. - You're cheating.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.29,1:01:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我耍赖? - 对 这就叫耍赖\N- I'm cheating? - Yeah, that's called cheating.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.08,1:01:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没守规矩 - 行吧 分给你\N- You're not following the rules. - Fine. Take the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.38,1:01:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 把球给我 1比1\N- Thank you. Give me the ball. - One-one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.92,1:01:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,操\NFuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.21,1:01:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好险 打得好 打得好\N- That was close. - That was good. That was good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.63,1:01:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不不不不不\NOh. No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.34,1:01:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 拿走吧\NNo, no. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.51,1:01:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我本该让你五分的 伙计\NI should have spotted you, like, five points, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.72,1:01:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天够倒霉了 留着吧\NYou've had a rough enough day already. Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.14,1:01:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 兄弟 谢谢\NThank you, brother. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.47,1:01:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没事儿\NIt's all good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.85,1:01:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,打得不错\NGood game.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.10,1:01:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 亚当 亚当 走着\NAll right, Adam. Adam, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.36,1:01:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你想押多少? 我能出五毛\N- What do you want to put on? - I can go 50 cents.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.69,1:01:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你有球吗?\NYou got a ball?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.82,1:01:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的鼻子怎么了?\NWhat happened to your nose?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.15,1:01:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我有球 我有球\NI got one, I got one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.53,1:01:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有个乘客赖账跑了\NFare ran out on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.41,1:01:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,赖什么账? 发生什么了?\NFare from what? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.62,1:01:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个计程车司机 曼哈顿来的\NI'm a taxi driver. From Manhattan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.91,1:01:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,曼哈顿? 昂\N- Manhattan? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.20,1:01:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那路费可不便宜 伙计\NThat's an expensive trip, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.75,1:01:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 可不是 二十 二十五块钱呢\NOh, yeah. $20, $25.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.62,1:01:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,碰上有钱的主儿能给五块小费\NWell, the high rollers tip five,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.67,1:01:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是五块小费 而且...\Nso that's five in tips. And...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.00,1:01:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈刚送到地方 那家伙就勒住我\NI fucking get to the spot, the guy chokes me out,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.09,1:01:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对着我后脑勺一顿猛拳 - 不会吧\N- punching me in the back of the head. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.84,1:01:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,抢了我的钱拔腿就跑\NTakes my money and run the fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.34,1:02:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我追上那混蛋 嘿 结果...\NCaught up to the motherfucker, and, boy...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.80,1:02:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我把他揍得眼冒金星 伙计\NI beat the brights off that motherfucker, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.18,1:02:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我搜了他全身\NAnd I took what he had.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.73,1:02:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你把他搜刮了?\NYou took what he had?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.98,1:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然! 你他妈说对了\NHell, yeah! You fucking damn right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.40,1:02:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你把那钱加进你的那叠钞票里了? 当然了\N- You added that to your roll? - Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.86,1:02:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就在我刚才看你掏出的那厚厚一叠里\NTo that fat roll I've seen you pulling out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.15,1:02:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是原则 问题在于他妈的原则\NIt's principle. It's fucking principle!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.65,1:02:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂 我要是你就把它藏好\NI understand that. I would keep it hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.32,1:02:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿这种地方 最好别露白\NI would keep that down, if I were you, in this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.28,1:02:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你 可不是谁都像克里斯蒂安这么面善\NNot everybody's as nice as Christian is, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.07,1:02:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我想说的\NThat's my point.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.45,1:02:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那在那儿坐着的混蛋又是谁?\NWhat about that asshole right there?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.33,1:02:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪他妈知道那是谁\NI don't know who the fuck that guy is.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.16,1:02:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能那样发球 怎么不能?\N- You can't serve like that. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.08,1:02:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我这么发球都好几年了\NI've been serving like that for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.29,1:02:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 罗杰 罗杰 嘿 太荒谬了\N- Hey, Roger. Roger. Hello. - That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.96,1:02:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,再给我一分钟 我们的球道空出来了\N- Give me one more minute. - Our lane is open.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.63,1:02:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,球道能等 没事儿 不行 咱们得马上走\N- The lane can wait. It's fine. - No, we gotta go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.84,1:02:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,人家要让给别人了 我正打球呢\N- They're gonna give it away. - I'm playing now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.67,1:02:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我为了打保龄球等了一晚上 赶紧的 走啊\NI have been waiting all night to bowl. Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.89,1:02:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,罗杰 我得分\N- Roger. - My point.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.01,1:02:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你干的好事\NLook what you made me do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.39,1:02:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了\NI gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.47,1:02:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说你要走是什么意思? - 把那一块钱还我\N- What do you mean you gotta go? - Give me my dollar back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.77,1:02:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,球还没打完呢\NWe're in the middle of a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.98,1:02:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那就算你弃权 把钱给我\NYou forfeit the game, then. Give me my dollar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.81,1:02:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把钱还给我! - 别激动 退后点\N- Give me my dollar back! - Relax. Back up, back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.73,1:02:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他要走人? - 你还没打完这局\N- He's gonna leave the game? - You didn't finish the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.02,1:02:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊 那你来打 你来打\NAll right, then you play. Then you play.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.57,1:02:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我没钱了 伙计 最后十块都给他了\NI'm broke, man. I gave him my last ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.15,1:02:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你打\NI'll play you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.24,1:02:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 喔 喔\NWhoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.82,1:03:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 没想到你们也打乒乓球\NOh, wow. I didn't know you guys played table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.70,1:03:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,出一块钱 你有一块钱吗?\NPut up a dollar. Do you have a dollar?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.53,1:03:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 操你 出五块 - 你哪来的五块钱\N- Fuck you. Put up five. - You don't have five dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.62,1:03:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 哇 你肯定是抢了谁吧\NOh, wow. You must have robbed someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.41,1:03:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,少废话 拿钱说话\NPut your money where your mouth is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.67,1:03:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,干脆我拿老二塞住你的嘴?\NWhy don't I put my penis where your mouth is?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.09,1:03:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,红衣服的 沃利 还有他妈的随便谁\NRed shirt, Wally and whatever the fuck his name is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.51,1:03:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,先记账 宝贝 我马上回来\NMark it blank, baby. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.43,1:03:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪?\NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.14,1:03:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我会记账的!\NI will mark it blank!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.98,1:03:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿干嘛呢?\NWhat's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.15,1:03:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这黑小子要把钱输光了\NThe colored boy is about to lose all his money.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.95,1:03:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 输给这混蛋了\NYeah, to this asshole right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.87,1:03:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 操! - 赛点\N- Fuck! - Match point.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.16,1:03:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赛点 来了 - 沃利! 加油!\N- Match point. Here we go. - Wally! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.20,1:03:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别输不起啊 沃利 开始吧\NDon't get upset though, Wally. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.17,1:03:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好球!\NYeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.30,1:03:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,擦边了 你他妈看到了\NIt grazed the edge. You fucking saw that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.88,1:03:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没擦边\NIt didn't graze the edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.17,1:04:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 球路变了 你看到了 - 没擦边\N- It changed. You saw that. - It didn't graze the edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.76,1:04:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 少废话 给钱 - 搞什么鬼?\N- No, give me my money. - What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.84,1:04:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把钱给我 - 这简直是...\N- Give me my money. - This is b--
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.80,1:04:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱给我 钱给我\NGive me the money. Give me the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.31,1:04:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 付钱 - 拜托了\N- Pay me. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.39,1:04:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,留五块给我当油钱吧\NLet me hold five for gas money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.52,1:04:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 没钱就别瞎赌\NNo. You shouldn't bet with money you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.68,1:04:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我他妈怎么回家? - 走回去\N- How the fuck am I gonna get home? - Walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.44,1:04:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就让他留五块吧\NJust let him keep five.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.85,1:04:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 你整晚都像个烂人\N- No. - You've been a dick all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.02,1:04:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给钱 - 别那么贪得无厌\N- Give me my money. - Just stop being greedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.15,1:04:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给他五块回家吧! - 真是放屁!\N- Just give him five to get home! - This is bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.03,1:04:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你他妈居然还笑 - 操你的!\N- And you're fucking smiling. - Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.03,1:04:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱给我 钱给我\NGive me the money. Give me the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.78,1:04:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的\NFuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.91,1:04:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 把那五块还他 - 我不想\N- Yo, give him his five. - I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.66,1:04:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈到底怎么回家?\NHow the fuck am I gonna get home?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.20,1:04:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是满嘴喷粪的下场\NThat's what happens when you talk shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.58,1:04:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 滋味不好受吧? - 操!\N- It stinks, doesn't it? - Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.33,1:04:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗杰呢? 罗杰在哪? - 该死\N- Where's-- Where's Roger? - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.75,1:04:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 我在 - 来了 罗杰!\N- Yeah, I got it. - Yeah, Rog!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.58,1:04:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,跟这蠢货打一局 把他油钱赢回来\NPlay this numbnuts for his gas money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.12,1:04:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你跟罗杰打 听到了吗?\NYou're gonna play Roger now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.08,1:04:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上吧 罗杰 - 上\N- Let's go, Roger. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.46,1:04:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马上开始 - 你?\N- Let's go right now. - You?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.55,1:04:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不跟你打 你太厉害了\NI won't play you. You're too good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.01,1:04:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你四分\NI'll spot you four points.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.93,1:04:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,行赌四十块\NFine. Forty dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.55,1:04:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,四十块? 我没这么多钱\NForty dollars? I don't have forty dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.26,1:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想打就打 不打拉倒 我得走了\NYou want it? Take it or leave it. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.18,1:04:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四十块 - 一 二 三...\N- Forty dollars. - One, two, three...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.35,1:04:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 谁有现金? 谁有现钱?\NCome on, who's got cash? Who's got cash?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.48,1:04:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我帮你 - 这是沃利队 加油\N- I got you. - It's Team Wally. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.36,1:04:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,凑一凑 凑一凑 让他有钱回家 快点\NPitch in, pitch in. Let's get him home. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.73,1:05:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家 谢谢\NThank you, everybody. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.19,1:05:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会让你回家的 肯定让你回家\NWe're gonna get you home. We're gonna get you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.44,1:05:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 这一排都没钱?\NGreat. Great. Nothing? This whole row?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.16,1:05:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我加个外注\NYo, I'll put a side bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.53,1:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,多少?\NHow much?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.62,1:05:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五块 - 你就这点钱?\N- Five dollars. - You don't got more than that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.29,1:05:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,十块 哟 还有点小钱嘛\NTen. Ooh, you got a little bit of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.33,1:05:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 非常感谢\NThank you. Thanks so much.
