Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.01,1:06:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我给你买个出租车牌照 - 我不他妈要什么牌照 毛瑟\N- I'll buy you a medallion. - I don't want no fucking medallion, Mouse.
